window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a438-1cbd00ca7d942496.json"]={sha256:"1cbd00ca7d942496c972acc96b7d06ee53d25cc1b6973e51b54936f1208a16cd",value:{"id":"a438","title":"環形雷射陀螺儀","titleEn":"Ring-laser gyroscopes","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從主動環形雷射腔中兩道反向行進光束的頻率差出發，推導比例因子 4A/(λL)，理解背向散射鎖定為何需要機械抖動，再把 Zerodur 腔體、超低損耗鏡、對稱放電、路徑長度控制與 Allan 偏差誤差預算整合成可交付的慣性量測單元工程。","summaryEn":"Start from the frequency difference between the two counter-propagating beams of an active ring-laser cavity, derive the 4A/(λL) scale factor, see why backscatter lock-in demands mechanical dither, then integrate the Zerodur block, ultralow-loss mirrors, symmetric discharge, path-length control and an Allan-deviation error budget into a deliverable inertial-measurement-unit engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-precision-metrology","subcategoryTitle":"光頻標準、慣性感測與干涉量測","subcategoryTitleEn":"Optical frequency standards, inertial sensing and interferometric metrology","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-precision-metrology","learningTags":["optics","optics-precision-metrology","inertial"],"architectureFamily":"inertial","architectureNodes":[["HeNe 對稱放電增益段","HeNe symmetric-discharge gain legs"],["Zerodur 環形腔體與超鏡","Zerodur ring block and supermirrors"],["路徑長度控制壓電鏡","Path-length-control piezo mirror"],["抖動馬達與抖動剝除","Dither motor and dither stripping"],["合光稜鏡與正交光電讀出","Combining prism and quadrature photodiode readout"],["慣性導航計算機","Inertial navigation computer"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[3,5],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"inertial","labels":["HeNe 對稱放電增益段","Zerodur 環形腔體與超鏡","路徑長度控制壓電鏡","抖動馬達與抖動剝除","合光稜鏡與正交光電讀出"],"labelsEn":["HeNe symmetric-discharge gain legs","Zerodur ring block and supermirrors","Path-length-control piezo mirror","Dither motor and dither stripping","Combining prism and quadrature photodiode readout"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"環形雷射陀螺儀設計練習：正三角形環、邊長 0.10 m，L = 0.30 m，A = (√3/4)×0.01 = 4.33×10⁻³ m²，λ = 632.8 nm。比例因子 S = 4A/(λL) = 0.01732/(1.898×10⁻⁷) ≈ 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s)，每條紋 2.26 arcsec。在北緯 25° 水平放置，地球自轉拍頻 = 9.12×10⁴×7.292×10⁻⁵×0.4226 ≈ 2.81 Hz。取背向散射 r_s = 1×10⁻⁶：f_L = c·r_s/(2πL) ≈ 159 Hz，鎖定門檻 Ω_L = 159/9.12×10⁴ ≈ 1.74×10⁻³ rad/s ≈ 0.10 °/s，比地球自轉大 24 倍，所以不抖動就讀不到地球自轉。加入 400 Hz、100 arcsec 峰值的抖動：Ω_d ≈ 1.22 rad/s ≈ 70 °/s，殘餘 ARW ≈ Ω_L/√(2π·S·Ω_d) ≈ 2.1×10⁻⁶ rad/√s ≈ 0.007 °/√h。若零偏不穩定度 0.01 °/h，10 min 陀螺羅經對準的航向誤差 ≈ √(2.5² + 4.3²) arcmin ≈ 5 arcmin（ARW 0.007 °/√h 的 10 min 殘餘為 0.017 °/h → 4.3 arcmin）。所有數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Ring-laser gyro design exercise: equilateral triangle of side 0.10 m, L = 0.30 m, A = (√3/4)×0.01 = 4.33×10⁻³ m², λ = 632.8 nm. Scale factor S = 4A/(λL) = 0.01732/(1.898×10⁻⁷) ≈ 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s), 2.26 arcsec per fringe. Placed horizontally at 25° N, the Earth-rate beat is 9.12×10⁴×7.292×10⁻⁵×0.4226 ≈ 2.81 Hz. With backscatter r_s = 1×10⁻⁶: f_L = c·r_s/(2πL) ≈ 159 Hz and the lock-in threshold Ω_L = 159/9.12×10⁴ ≈ 1.74×10⁻³ rad/s ≈ 0.10 °/s, 24 times Earth rate, so without dither Earth rotation is unreadable. Adding 400 Hz dither at 100 arcsec peak: Ω_d ≈ 1.22 rad/s ≈ 70 °/s and residual ARW ≈ Ω_L/√(2π·S·Ω_d) ≈ 2.1×10⁻⁶ rad/√s ≈ 0.007 °/√h. With 0.01 °/h bias instability, a 10 min gyrocompass alignment gives heading error ≈ √(2.5² + 4.3²) arcmin ≈ 5 arcmin (the 10 min residual of 0.007 °/√h is 0.017 °/h → 4.3 arcmin). All values are teaching assumptions, not any product's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a438-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子」與「鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor\" and \"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a438-v12-01","title":"Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「反向行進光束與拍頻」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Counter-propagating beams and beat frequency” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"環形雷射陀螺儀的環形腔內同時振盪順時針與逆時針兩道 HeNe 雷射模態；腔體不轉動時兩者頻率相同，腔體以角速率 Ω 繞法線旋轉時，順轉方向的有效周長變長、逆轉方向變短，兩模態的諧振頻率因此分裂。把兩道光在合光稜鏡上疊加，光電二極體看到的條紋移動速率就是拍頻 Δf，它與 Ω 成正比，比例常數只取決於幾何面積、周長與波長，所以它是一個不含運動件的角速率積分器：累計條紋數就是累計轉角。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「反向行進光束與拍頻」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A ring-laser gyroscope sustains clockwise and counter-clockwise HeNe modes in one ring cavity. At rest they share one frequency; when the block rotates at rate Ω about its normal, the effective perimeter grows for the co-rotating beam and shrinks for the counter-rotating one, so the two resonances split. Recombined on a prism, the beams give photodiodes a fringe-motion rate equal to the beat frequency Δf, which is proportional to Ω with a constant set only by enclosed area, perimeter and wavelength. The device is therefore a rate integrator with no moving parts: counting fringes counts angle. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Counter-propagating beams and beat frequency”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：比例因子 S = 4A/(λL)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Scale factor S = 4A/(λL).","failure":"常見誤解：「環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「反向行進光束與拍頻」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Counter-propagating beams and beat frequency”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-01-k1","title":"Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子","titleEn":"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor","text":"環形雷射陀螺儀的環形腔內同時振盪順時針與逆時針兩道 HeNe 雷射模態；腔體不轉動時兩者頻率相同，腔體以角速率 Ω 繞法線旋轉時，順轉方向的有效周長變長、逆轉方向變短，兩模態的諧振頻率因此分裂。把兩道光在合光稜鏡上疊加，光電二極體看到的條紋移動速率就是拍頻 Δf，它與 Ω 成正比，比例常數只取決於幾何面積、周長與波長，所以它是一個不含運動件的角速率積分器：累計條紋數就是累計轉角。","textEn":"A ring-laser gyroscope sustains clockwise and counter-clockwise HeNe modes in one ring cavity. At rest they share one frequency; when the block rotates at rate Ω about its normal, the effective perimeter grows for the co-rotating beam and shrinks for the counter-rotating one, so the two resonances split.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor\" is correct?","options":["環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。","環形雷射陀螺儀的環形腔內同時振盪順時針與逆時針兩道 HeNe 雷射模態。","鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。"],"optionsEn":["A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.","A ring-laser gyroscope sustains clockwise and counter-clockwise HeNe modes in one ring cavity.","Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates."],"answer":1,"explanation":"環形雷射陀螺儀的環形腔內同時振盪順時針與逆時針兩道 HeNe 雷射模態；腔體不轉動時兩者頻率相同，腔體以角速率 Ω 繞法線旋轉時，順轉方向的有效周長變長、逆轉方向變短，兩模態的諧振頻率因此分裂。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A ring-laser gyroscope sustains clockwise and counter-clockwise HeNe modes in one ring cavity. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a438-v12-02","title":"Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子：定量估算","titleEn":"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「反向行進光束與拍頻」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Counter-propagating beams and beat frequency” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：比例因子 S = 4A/(λL)。教學假設：正三角形環、邊長 0.10 m，則 L = 0.30 m、A = 4.33×10⁻³ m²，λ = 632.8 nm，S = 4×4.33×10⁻³/(632.8×10⁻⁹×0.30) ≈ 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s)，即約 1592 Hz/(°/s)；一個條紋對應 1/S = 1.10×10⁻⁵ rad ≈ 2.26 arcsec。地球自轉 7.292×10⁻⁵ rad/s 給出 6.65 Hz 的滿額拍頻，水平放置在北緯 25° 時只感測垂直分量 sin25° = 0.4226，拍頻 2.81 Hz。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Scale factor S = 4A/(λL). Teaching assumption: an equilateral triangle of side 0.10 m gives L = 0.30 m and A = 4.33×10⁻³ m²; with λ = 632.8 nm, S = 4×4.33×10⁻³/(632.8×10⁻⁹×0.30) ≈ 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s), about 1592 Hz/(°/s), and one fringe equals 1/S = 1.10×10⁻⁵ rad ≈ 2.26 arcsec. Earth rotation at 7.292×10⁻⁵ rad/s gives a 6.65 Hz full beat; a horizontal ring at 25° N senses only the vertical component sin25° = 0.4226, so 2.81 Hz. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把陀螺儀固定在靜止平台並把輸入軸轉到垂直，以頻率計數器量拍頻並與 S·Ω_E·sinφ 比較；再把輸入軸轉到水平的東西向，拍頻應降到接近鎖定區內，證明感測的是沿法線的旋轉分量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Fix the gyro on a static platform with its input axis vertical, measure the beat with a frequency counter and compare with S·Ω_E·sinφ; then turn the input axis horizontal east–west and confirm the beat falls toward the lock-in band, proving that only the component along the normal is sensed.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"比例因子 S = 4A/(λL)。教學假設：正三角形環、邊長 0.10 m，則 L = 0.30 m、A = 4.33×10⁻³ m²，λ = 632.8 nm，S = 4×4.33×10⁻³/(632.8×10⁻⁹×0.30) ≈ 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s)，即約 1592 Hz/(°/s)；一個條紋對應 1/S = 1.10×10⁻⁵ rad ≈ 2.26 arcsec。地球自轉 7.292×10⁻⁵ rad/s 給出 6.65 Hz 的滿額拍頻，水平放置在北緯 25° 時只感測垂直分量 sin25° = 0.4226，拍頻 2.81 Hz。","textEn":"Scale factor S = 4A/(λL). Teaching assumption: an equilateral triangle of side 0.10 m gives L = 0.30 m and A = 4.33×10⁻³ m²; with λ = 632.8 nm, S = 4×4.33×10⁻³/(632.8×10⁻⁹×0.30) ≈ 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s), about 1592 Hz/(°/s), and one fringe equals 1/S = 1.10×10⁻⁵ rad ≈ 2.26 arcsec. Earth rotation at 7.292×10⁻⁵ rad/s gives a 6.65 Hz full beat; a horizontal ring at 25° N senses only the vertical component sin25° = 0.4226, so 2.81 Hz.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor\", which statement holds?","options":["只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。","平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。","比例因子 S = 4A/(λL)。"],"optionsEn":["With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias.","Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller.","Scale factor S = 4A/(λL)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"比例因子 S = 4A/(λL)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Scale factor S = 4A/(λL). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a438-v12-03","title":"Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「反向行進光束與拍頻」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Counter-propagating beams and beat frequency” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把陀螺儀固定在靜止平台並把輸入軸轉到垂直，以頻率計數器量拍頻並與 S·Ω_E·sinφ 比較；再把輸入軸轉到水平的東西向，拍頻應降到接近鎖定區內，證明感測的是沿法線的旋轉分量。用當地緯度與公開的地球自轉速率反算 S，偏差應在幾十 ppm 內，否則幾何或波長假設有錯。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Fix the gyro on a static platform with its input axis vertical, measure the beat with a frequency counter and compare with S·Ω_E·sinφ; then turn the input axis horizontal east–west and confirm the beat falls toward the lock-in band, proving that only the component along the normal is sensed. Back out S from the local latitude and the public Earth rate; the discrepancy should be within tens of ppm or the geometry or wavelength assumption is wrong. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若把腔長計算成實體周長而忽略氣體折射率與鏡面相位深度，S 會偏差數十 ppm；在一小時 10,000° 的累計轉動中，50 ppm 的比例因子誤差等於 0.5° 的航向誤差，遠超過導航級允收。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Computing cavity length as the physical perimeter while ignoring gas refractive index and mirror phase depth biases S by tens of ppm; over 10,000° accumulated in an hour, a 50 ppm scale-factor error equals 0.5° of heading error, far beyond navigation-grade acceptance.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把陀螺儀固定在靜止平台並把輸入軸轉到垂直，以頻率計數器量拍頻並與 S·Ω_E·sinφ 比較；再把輸入軸轉到水平的東西向，拍頻應降到接近鎖定區內，證明感測的是沿法線的旋轉分量。用當地緯度與公開的地球自轉速率反算 S，偏差應在幾十 ppm 內，否則幾何或波長假設有錯。","textEn":"Fix the gyro on a static platform with its input axis vertical, measure the beat with a frequency counter and compare with S·Ω_E·sinφ; then turn the input axis horizontal east–west and confirm the beat falls toward the lock-in band, proving that only the component along the normal is sensed. Back out S from the local latitude and the public Earth rate; the discrepancy should be within tens of ppm or the geometry or wavelength assumption is wrong.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor\"?","options":["把陀螺儀固定在靜止平台並把輸入軸轉到垂直，以頻率計數器量拍頻並與 S·Ω_E·sinφ 比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。"],"optionsEn":["Fix the gyro on a static platform with its input axis vertical, measure the beat with a frequency counter and compare with S·Ω_E·sinφ.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把陀螺儀固定在靜止平台並把輸入軸轉到垂直，以頻率計數器量拍頻並與 S·Ω_E·sinφ 比較；再把輸入軸轉到水平的東西向，拍頻應降到接近鎖定區內，證明感測的是沿法線的旋轉分量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Fix the gyro on a static platform with its input axis vertical, measure the beat with a frequency counter and compare with S·Ω_E·sinφ; then turn the input axis horizontal east–west and confirm the beat falls toward the lock-in band, proving that only the component along the normal is sensed. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a438-v12-04","title":"Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「反向行進光束與拍頻」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Counter-propagating beams and beat frequency” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若把腔長計算成實體周長而忽略氣體折射率與鏡面相位深度，S 會偏差數十 ppm；在一小時 10,000° 的累計轉動中，50 ppm 的比例因子誤差等於 0.5° 的航向誤差，遠超過導航級允收。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Computing cavity length as the physical perimeter while ignoring gas refractive index and mirror phase depth biases S by tens of ppm; over 10,000° accumulated in an hour, a 50 ppm scale-factor error equals 0.5° of heading error, far beyond navigation-grade acceptance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：把兩道光在合光稜鏡上疊加，光電二極體看到的條紋移動速率就是拍頻 Δf，它與 Ω 成正比，比例常數只取決於幾何面積、周長與波長，所以它是一個不含運動件的角速率積分器：累計條紋數就是累計轉角。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The device is therefore a rate integrator with no moving parts: counting fringes counts angle.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把腔長計算成實體周長而忽略氣體折射率與鏡面相位深度，S 會偏差數十 ppm；在一小時 10,000° 的累計轉動中，50 ppm 的比例因子誤差等於 0.5° 的航向誤差，遠超過導航級允收。","textEn":"Computing cavity length as the physical perimeter while ignoring gas refractive index and mirror phase depth biases S by tens of ppm; over 10,000° accumulated in an hour, a 50 ppm scale-factor error equals 0.5° of heading error, far beyond navigation-grade acceptance.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Sagnac 效應與主動環形腔的比例因子」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sagnac effect and the active-cavity scale factor\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若把腔長計算成實體周長而忽略氣體折射率與鏡面相位深度，S 會偏差數十 ppm。","鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Computing cavity length as the physical perimeter while ignoring gas refractive index and mirror phase depth biases S by tens of ppm.","Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把腔長計算成實體周長而忽略氣體折射率與鏡面相位深度，S 會偏差數十 ppm；在一小時 10,000° 的累計轉動中，50 ppm 的比例因子誤差等於 0.5° 的航向誤差，遠超過導航級允收。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Computing cavity length as the physical perimeter while ignoring gas refractive index and mirror phase depth biases S by tens of ppm; over 10,000° accumulated in an hour, a 50 ppm scale-factor error equals 0.5° of heading error, far beyond navigation-grade acceptance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a438-v12-05","title":"鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「背向散射與抖動馬達」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Backscatter and dither motor” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"鏡面上奈米級的散射把一小部分順時針光耦合到逆時針模態，兩個振盪器因而互相牽引；當拍頻低於耦合強度時，兩模態鎖成同一頻率，陀螺儀對小角速率完全沒有輸出。這個死區由 Adler 鎖定方程 dψ/dt = Δω − ω_L·sinψ 描述，ω_L 正比於每圈的背向散射振幅 r_s 乘以自由光譜範圍 c/L。工程解法是讓整個腔體以數百赫茲作微小扭轉抖動，使瞬時角速率絕大部分時間遠高於鎖定門檻，只在每次過零時留下隨機相位誤差。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「背向散射與抖動馬達」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Nanometre-scale scatter at the mirrors couples a little clockwise light into the counter-clockwise mode, and the two oscillators pull on each other; when the beat falls below the coupling strength the modes lock to one frequency and the gyro reads zero for small rates. The dead band follows the Adler equation dψ/dt = Δω − ω_L·sinψ, with ω_L proportional to the per-round-trip backscatter amplitude r_s times the free spectral range c/L. The engineering remedy twists the whole block at a few hundred hertz so that the instantaneous rate stays far above threshold almost all the time, leaving only a random phase error at each zero crossing. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Backscatter and dither motor”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：鎖定拍頻 f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL)，換成角速率 Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Lock-in beat f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL), or in rate Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA).","failure":"常見誤解：「鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「背向散射與抖動馬達」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Backscatter and dither motor”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-05-k1","title":"鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動","titleEn":"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither","text":"鏡面上奈米級的散射把一小部分順時針光耦合到逆時針模態，兩個振盪器因而互相牽引；當拍頻低於耦合強度時，兩模態鎖成同一頻率，陀螺儀對小角速率完全沒有輸出。這個死區由 Adler 鎖定方程 dψ/dt = Δω − ω_L·sinψ 描述，ω_L 正比於每圈的背向散射振幅 r_s 乘以自由光譜範圍 c/L。","textEn":"Nanometre-scale scatter at the mirrors couples a little clockwise light into the counter-clockwise mode, and the two oscillators pull on each other; when the beat falls below the coupling strength the modes lock to one frequency and the gyro reads zero for small rates. The dead band follows the Adler equation dψ/dt = Δω − ω_L·sinψ, with ω_L proportional to the per-round-trip backscatter amplitude r_s times the free spectral range c/L.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither\" is correct?","options":["鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。","普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。","鏡面上奈米級的散射把一小部分順時針光耦合到逆時針模態，兩個振盪器因而互相牽引；當拍頻低於耦合強度時，兩模態鎖成同一頻率，陀螺儀對小角速率完全沒有輸出。"],"optionsEn":["Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates.","An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate.","Nanometre-scale scatter at the mirrors couples a little clockwise light into the counter-clockwise mode, and the two oscillators pull on each other."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鏡面上奈米級的散射把一小部分順時針光耦合到逆時針模態，兩個振盪器因而互相牽引；當拍頻低於耦合強度時，兩模態鎖成同一頻率，陀螺儀對小角速率完全沒有輸出。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Nanometre-scale scatter at the mirrors couples a little clockwise light into the counter-clockwise mode, and the two oscillators pull on each other; when the beat falls below the coupling strength the modes lock to one frequency and the gyro reads zero for small rates. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a438-v12-06","title":"鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動：定量估算","titleEn":"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「背向散射與抖動馬達」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Backscatter and dither motor” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：鎖定拍頻 f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL)，換成角速率 Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA)。取 r_s = 1×10⁻⁶、L = 0.30 m：f_L ≈ 159 Hz，Ω_L ≈ 1.74×10⁻³ rad/s ≈ 0.10 °/s ≈ 360 °/h。抖動 400 Hz、峰值幅度 100 arcsec 時峰值角速率 Ω_d = 2π·400·4.85×10⁻⁴ ≈ 1.22 rad/s ≈ 70 °/s，死區時間占比約 (2/π)(Ω_L/Ω_d) ≈ 9×10⁻⁴；正弦抖動下殘餘角度隨機漫步的量級估計 ARW ≈ Ω_L/√(2π·S·Ω_d) ≈ 2.1×10⁻⁶ rad/√s ≈ 0.007 °/√h。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Lock-in beat f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL), or in rate Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA). With r_s = 1×10⁻⁶ and L = 0.30 m: f_L ≈ 159 Hz, Ω_L ≈ 1.74×10⁻³ rad/s ≈ 0.10 °/s ≈ 360 °/h. Dither at 400 Hz with 100 arcsec peak gives Ω_d = 2π·400·4.85×10⁻⁴ ≈ 1.22 rad/s ≈ 70 °/s, a dead-band time fraction of about (2/π)(Ω_L/Ω_d) ≈ 9×10⁻⁴, and an order-of-magnitude residual angle random walk ARW ≈ Ω_L/√(2π·S·Ω_d) ≈ 2.1×10⁻⁶ rad/√s ≈ 0.007 °/√h. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：關閉抖動，把陀螺儀放在速率轉台上由零緩慢加速，記錄拍頻首次出現的輸入速率，就是鎖定門檻；再開啟抖動，用抖動拾取器訊號從輸出中剝除抖動分量，確認低速率輸出恢復線性，並以長時間靜態資料的 Allan 偏差斜率 −1/2 段估計 ARW，與模型比較數量級。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: With dither off, place the gyro on a rate table and ramp slowly from zero; the input rate at which a beat first appears is the lock-in threshold.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"鎖定拍頻 f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL)，換成角速率 Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA)。取 r_s = 1×10⁻⁶、L = 0.30 m：f_L ≈ 159 Hz，Ω_L ≈ 1.74×10⁻³ rad/s ≈ 0.10 °/s ≈ 360 °/h。抖動 400 Hz、峰值幅度 100 arcsec 時峰值角速率 Ω_d = 2π·400·4.85×10⁻⁴ ≈ 1.22 rad/s ≈ 70 °/s，死區時間占比約 (2/π)(Ω_L/Ω_d) ≈ 9×10⁻⁴；正弦抖動下殘餘角度隨機漫步的量級估計 ARW ≈ Ω_L/√(2π·S·Ω_d) ≈ 2.1×10⁻⁶ rad/√s ≈ 0.007 °/√h。","textEn":"Lock-in beat f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL), or in rate Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA). With r_s = 1×10⁻⁶ and L = 0.30 m: f_L ≈ 159 Hz, Ω_L ≈ 1.74×10⁻³ rad/s ≈ 0.10 °/s ≈ 360 °/h. Dither at 400 Hz with 100 arcsec peak gives Ω_d = 2π·400·4.85×10⁻⁴ ≈ 1.22 rad/s ≈ 70 °/s, a dead-band time fraction of about (2/π)(Ω_L/Ω_d) ≈ 9×10⁻⁴, and an order-of-magnitude residual angle random walk ARW ≈ Ω_L/√(2π·S·Ω_d) ≈ 2.1×10⁻⁶ rad/√s ≈ 0.007 °/√h.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither\", which statement holds?","options":["鎖定拍頻 f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL)，換成角速率 Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA)。","比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。","環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。"],"optionsEn":["Lock-in beat f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL), or in rate Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA).","Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration.","A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"鎖定拍頻 f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL)，換成角速率 Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Lock-in beat f_L ≈ c·r_s/(2πL), or in rate Ω_L = f_L/S = cλr_s/(8πA). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a438-v12-07","title":"鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「背向散射與抖動馬達」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Backscatter and dither motor” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"關閉抖動，把陀螺儀放在速率轉台上由零緩慢加速，記錄拍頻首次出現的輸入速率，就是鎖定門檻；再開啟抖動，用抖動拾取器訊號從輸出中剝除抖動分量，確認低速率輸出恢復線性，並以長時間靜態資料的 Allan 偏差斜率 −1/2 段估計 ARW，與模型比較數量級。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"With dither off, place the gyro on a rate table and ramp slowly from zero; the input rate at which a beat first appears is the lock-in threshold. Turn dither on, strip the dither component from the output using the dither pick-off signal, confirm that low-rate output is linear again, and estimate ARW from the slope −1/2 segment of a long static Allan deviation, comparing order of magnitude with the model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：鏡面微粒污染或鍍膜老化使 r_s 上升一個數量級，鎖定門檻隨之上升十倍、ARW 同步惡化；若抖動振幅又因撓性彈簧疲勞下降，死區占比急升，靜態漂移與隨機漫步同時超出規格。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Particle contamination or coating ageing that raises r_s by an order of magnitude raises the lock-in threshold tenfold and degrades ARW with it; if the dither amplitude also drops through flexure-spring fatigue, the dead-band fraction jumps and both static drift and random walk exceed specification.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"關閉抖動，把陀螺儀放在速率轉台上由零緩慢加速，記錄拍頻首次出現的輸入速率，就是鎖定門檻；再開啟抖動，用抖動拾取器訊號從輸出中剝除抖動分量，確認低速率輸出恢復線性，並以長時間靜態資料的 Allan 偏差斜率 −1/2 段估計 ARW，與模型比較數量級。","textEn":"With dither off, place the gyro on a rate table and ramp slowly from zero; the input rate at which a beat first appears is the lock-in threshold. Turn dither on, strip the dither component from the output using the dither pick-off signal, confirm that low-rate output is linear again, and estimate ARW from the slope −1/2 segment of a long static Allan deviation, comparing order of magnitude with the model.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","關閉抖動，把陀螺儀放在速率轉台上由零緩慢加速，記錄拍頻首次出現的輸入速率，就是鎖定門檻。","陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","With dither off, place the gyro on a rate table and ramp slowly from zero; the input rate at which a beat first appears is the lock-in threshold.","Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"關閉抖動，把陀螺儀放在速率轉台上由零緩慢加速，記錄拍頻首次出現的輸入速率，就是鎖定門檻；再開啟抖動，用抖動拾取器訊號從輸出中剝除抖動分量，確認低速率輸出恢復線性，並以長時間靜態資料的 Allan 偏差斜率 −1/2 段估計 ARW，與模型比較數量級。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"With dither off, place the gyro on a rate table and ramp slowly from zero; the input rate at which a beat first appears is the lock-in threshold. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a438-v12-08","title":"鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動：失效診斷","titleEn":"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「背向散射與抖動馬達」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Backscatter and dither motor” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"鏡面微粒污染或鍍膜老化使 r_s 上升一個數量級，鎖定門檻隨之上升十倍、ARW 同步惡化；若抖動振幅又因撓性彈簧疲勞下降，死區占比急升，靜態漂移與隨機漫步同時超出規格。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Particle contamination or coating ageing that raises r_s by an order of magnitude raises the lock-in threshold tenfold and degrades ARW with it; if the dither amplitude also drops through flexure-spring fatigue, the dead-band fraction jumps and both static drift and random walk exceed specification. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：工程解法是讓整個腔體以數百赫茲作微小扭轉抖動，使瞬時角速率絕大部分時間遠高於鎖定門檻，只在每次過零時留下隨機相位誤差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The engineering remedy twists the whole block at a few hundred hertz so that the instantaneous rate stays far above threshold almost all the time, leaving only a random phase error at each zero crossing.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鏡面微粒污染或鍍膜老化使 r_s 上升一個數量級，鎖定門檻隨之上升十倍、ARW 同步惡化；若抖動振幅又因撓性彈簧疲勞下降，死區占比急升，靜態漂移與隨機漫步同時超出規格。","textEn":"Particle contamination or coating ageing that raises r_s by an order of magnitude raises the lock-in threshold tenfold and degrades ARW with it; if the dither amplitude also drops through flexure-spring fatigue, the dead-band fraction jumps and both static drift and random walk exceed specification.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鎖定門檻、Adler 方程與機械抖動」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Lock-in threshold, the Adler equation and mechanical dither\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。","鏡面微粒污染或鍍膜老化使 r_s 上升一個數量級，鎖定門檻隨之上升十倍、ARW 同步惡化。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate.","Particle contamination or coating ageing that raises r_s by an order of magnitude raises the lock-in threshold tenfold and degrades ARW with it."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鏡面微粒污染或鍍膜老化使 r_s 上升一個數量級，鎖定門檻隨之上升十倍、ARW 同步惡化；若抖動振幅又因撓性彈簧疲勞下降，死區占比急升，靜態漂移與隨機漫步同時超出規格。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Particle contamination or coating ageing that raises r_s by an order of magnitude raises the lock-in threshold tenfold and degrades ARW with it; if the dither amplitude also drops through flexure-spring fatigue, the dead-band fraction jumps and both static drift and random walk exceed specification. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a438-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕」與「增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin\" and \"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a438-v12-09","title":"低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「Zerodur 腔體與超低損耗鏡」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Zerodur block and ultralow-loss mirrors” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"腔體由單塊 Zerodur 玻璃陶瓷鑽孔而成，三面或四面鏡以光學接觸直接貼在拋光的端面上，不用黏膠，使腔長與鏡面角度不隨溫度與時間漂移。鏡子是離子束濺鍍的多層介電質超鏡，單鏡散射加吸收只有數 ppm，因為 HeNe 在 632.8 nm 的單程增益只有千分之幾，整圈損耗必須遠小於增益才能起振，同時低散射又直接壓低鎖定門檻。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Zerodur 腔體與超低損耗鏡」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The block is a single piece of Zerodur glass-ceramic with bored channels; three or four mirrors are optically contacted to polished end faces without adhesive, so cavity length and mirror angles do not drift with temperature or time. The mirrors are ion-beam-sputtered dielectric supermirrors with a few ppm of scatter plus absorption per mirror, because the single-pass HeNe gain at 632.8 nm is only a few tenths of a percent: round-trip loss must stay well below gain for oscillation, and low scatter also directly lowers the lock-in threshold. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Zerodur block and ultralow-loss mirrors”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：熱膨脹造成的腔長變化 ΔL = α·L·ΔT。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Thermal cavity-length change is ΔL = α·L·ΔT.","failure":"常見誤解：「普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Zerodur 腔體與超低損耗鏡」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Zerodur block and ultralow-loss mirrors”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-09-k1","title":"低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕","titleEn":"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin","text":"腔體由單塊 Zerodur 玻璃陶瓷鑽孔而成，三面或四面鏡以光學接觸直接貼在拋光的端面上，不用黏膠，使腔長與鏡面角度不隨溫度與時間漂移。鏡子是離子束濺鍍的多層介電質超鏡，單鏡散射加吸收只有數 ppm，因為 HeNe 在 632.8 nm 的單程增益只有千分之幾，整圈損耗必須遠小於增益才能起振，同時低散射又直接壓低鎖定門檻。","textEn":"The block is a single piece of Zerodur glass-ceramic with bored channels; three or four mirrors are optically contacted to polished end faces without adhesive, so cavity length and mirror angles do not drift with temperature or time. The mirrors are ion-beam-sputtered dielectric supermirrors with a few ppm of scatter plus absorption per mirror, because the single-pass HeNe gain at 632.8 nm is only a few tenths of a percent: round-trip loss must stay well below gain for oscillation, and low scatter also directly lowers the lock-in threshold.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin\" is correct?","options":["腔體由單塊 Zerodur 玻璃陶瓷鑽孔而成，三面或四面鏡以光學接觸直接貼在拋光的端面上，不用黏膠，使腔長與鏡面角度不隨溫度與時間漂移。","普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。","只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。"],"optionsEn":["The block is a single piece of Zerodur glass-ceramic with bored channels.","An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate.","With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias."],"answer":0,"explanation":"腔體由單塊 Zerodur 玻璃陶瓷鑽孔而成，三面或四面鏡以光學接觸直接貼在拋光的端面上，不用黏膠，使腔長與鏡面角度不隨溫度與時間漂移。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The block is a single piece of Zerodur glass-ceramic with bored channels; three or four mirrors are optically contacted to polished end faces without adhesive, so cavity length and mirror angles do not drift with temperature or time. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a438-v12-10","title":"低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕：定量估算","titleEn":"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Zerodur 腔體與超低損耗鏡」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Zerodur block and ultralow-loss mirrors” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：熱膨脹造成的腔長變化 ΔL = α·L·ΔT。取 Zerodur 0 級 α = 0.02 ppm/K、L = 0.30 m、ΔT = 10 K：ΔL = 2×10⁻⁸×0.30×10 = 60 nm，約 0.1 個波長，對應光頻移 Δν = ν·ΔL/L ≈ 4.74×10¹⁴×2×10⁻⁷ ≈ 95 MHz，相對於約 1.5 GHz 的 HeNe 增益頻寬並不小，所以仍需主動路徑長度控制。損耗預算：三面鏡各 30 ppm 加繞射與窗口 10 ppm，整圈 100 ppm，對比 1000 ppm 的單程增益留有 10 倍餘裕。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Thermal cavity-length change is ΔL = α·L·ΔT. With Zerodur class 0 at α = 0.02 ppm/K, L = 0.30 m and ΔT = 10 K: ΔL = 2×10⁻⁸×0.30×10 = 60 nm, about 0.1 wavelength, an optical-frequency shift Δν = ν·ΔL/L ≈ 4.74×10¹⁴×2×10⁻⁷ ≈ 95 MHz, not small against the roughly 1.5 GHz HeNe gain bandwidth, so active path-length control is still needed. Loss budget: three mirrors at 30 ppm each plus 10 ppm diffraction and apertures give 100 ppm per round trip against a 1000 ppm single-pass gain, a tenfold margin. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以腔衰盪法（cavity ring-down）量每面鏡的總損耗並與供應商的 ppm 規格比對；把腔體放進溫控箱做 ±10 K 循環，記錄路徑長度控制壓電電壓的變化，由壓電的 nm/V 係數反推 ΔL，與 α·L·ΔT 的預測比較以確認 Zerodur 等級與光學接觸的穩定性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure each mirror's total loss by cavity ring-down and compare with the supplier's ppm specification; cycle the block ±10 K in a thermal chamber, log the path-length-control piezo voltage, convert through the piezo nm/V coefficient to ΔL and compare with the α·L·ΔT prediction to confirm the Zerodur grade and the stability of the optical contacts.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"熱膨脹造成的腔長變化 ΔL = α·L·ΔT。取 Zerodur 0 級 α = 0.02 ppm/K、L = 0.30 m、ΔT = 10 K：ΔL = 2×10⁻⁸×0.30×10 = 60 nm，約 0.1 個波長，對應光頻移 Δν = ν·ΔL/L ≈ 4.74×10¹⁴×2×10⁻⁷ ≈ 95 MHz，相對於約 1.5 GHz 的 HeNe 增益頻寬並不小，所以仍需主動路徑長度控制。損耗預算：三面鏡各 30 ppm 加繞射與窗口 10 ppm，整圈 100 ppm，對比 1000 ppm 的單程增益留有 10 倍餘裕。","textEn":"Thermal cavity-length change is ΔL = α·L·ΔT. With Zerodur class 0 at α = 0.02 ppm/K, L = 0.30 m and ΔT = 10 K: ΔL = 2×10⁻⁸×0.30×10 = 60 nm, about 0.1 wavelength, an optical-frequency shift Δν = ν·ΔL/L ≈ 4.74×10¹⁴×2×10⁻⁷ ≈ 95 MHz, not small against the roughly 1.5 GHz HeNe gain bandwidth, so active path-length control is still needed. Loss budget: three mirrors at 30 ppm each plus 10 ppm diffraction and apertures give 100 ppm per round trip against a 1000 ppm single-pass gain, a tenfold margin.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin\", which statement holds?","options":["平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。","熱膨脹造成的腔長變化 ΔL = α·L·ΔT。","陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。"],"optionsEn":["Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller.","Thermal cavity-length change is ΔL = α·L·ΔT.","Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"熱膨脹造成的腔長變化 ΔL = α·L·ΔT。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Thermal cavity-length change is ΔL = α·L·ΔT. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a438-v12-11","title":"低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Zerodur 腔體與超低損耗鏡」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Zerodur block and ultralow-loss mirrors” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以腔衰盪法（cavity ring-down）量每面鏡的總損耗並與供應商的 ppm 規格比對；把腔體放進溫控箱做 ±10 K 循環，記錄路徑長度控制壓電電壓的變化，由壓電的 nm/V 係數反推 ΔL，與 α·L·ΔT 的預測比較以確認 Zerodur 等級與光學接觸的穩定性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure each mirror's total loss by cavity ring-down and compare with the supplier's ppm specification; cycle the block ±10 K in a thermal chamber, log the path-length-control piezo voltage, convert through the piezo nm/V coefficient to ΔL and compare with the α·L·ΔT prediction to confirm the Zerodur grade and the stability of the optical contacts. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：光學接觸面若殘留微粒或濕氣，接觸會在溫度循環中局部脫開，鏡面角度跳動數 µrad，使模態橫向偏移、損耗突增而熄振；用黏膠補救則引入潛變與除氣污染鏡面。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Residual particles or moisture at an optical contact let the contact partially release under thermal cycling, the mirror angle jumps by microradians, the mode walks laterally, loss spikes and the laser extinguishes; gluing as a remedy brings creep and outgassing that contaminates the mirrors.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以腔衰盪法（cavity ring-down）量每面鏡的總損耗並與供應商的 ppm 規格比對；把腔體放進溫控箱做 ±10 K 循環，記錄路徑長度控制壓電電壓的變化，由壓電的 nm/V 係數反推 ΔL，與 α·L·ΔT 的預測比較以確認 Zerodur 等級與光學接觸的穩定性。","textEn":"Measure each mirror's total loss by cavity ring-down and compare with the supplier's ppm specification; cycle the block ±10 K in a thermal chamber, log the path-length-control piezo voltage, convert through the piezo nm/V coefficient to ΔL and compare with the α·L·ΔT prediction to confirm the Zerodur grade and the stability of the optical contacts.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。","以腔衰盪法（cavity ring-down）量每面鏡的總損耗並與供應商的 ppm 規格比對。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.","Measure each mirror's total loss by cavity ring-down and compare with the supplier's ppm specification."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以腔衰盪法（cavity ring-down）量每面鏡的總損耗並與供應商的 ppm 規格比對；把腔體放進溫控箱做 ±10 K 循環，記錄路徑長度控制壓電電壓的變化，由壓電的 nm/V 係數反推 ΔL，與 α·L·ΔT 的預測比較以確認 Zerodur 等級與光學接觸的穩定性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure each mirror's total loss by cavity ring-down and compare with the supplier's ppm specification; cycle the block ±10 K in a thermal chamber, log the path-length-control piezo voltage, convert through the piezo nm/V coefficient to ΔL and compare with the α·L·ΔT prediction to confirm the Zerodur grade and the stability of the optical contacts. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a438-v12-12","title":"低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕：失效診斷","titleEn":"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Zerodur 腔體與超低損耗鏡」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Zerodur block and ultralow-loss mirrors” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"光學接觸面若殘留微粒或濕氣，接觸會在溫度循環中局部脫開，鏡面角度跳動數 µrad，使模態橫向偏移、損耗突增而熄振；用黏膠補救則引入潛變與除氣污染鏡面。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Residual particles or moisture at an optical contact let the contact partially release under thermal cycling, the mirror angle jumps by microradians, the mode walks laterally, loss spikes and the laser extinguishes; gluing as a remedy brings creep and outgassing that contaminates the mirrors. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：鏡子是離子束濺鍍的多層介電質超鏡，單鏡散射加吸收只有數 ppm，因為 HeNe 在 632.8 nm 的單程增益只有千分之幾，整圈損耗必須遠小於增益才能起振，同時低散射又直接壓低鎖定門檻。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The mirrors are ion-beam-sputtered dielectric supermirrors with a few ppm of scatter plus absorption per mirror, because the single-pass HeNe gain at 632.8 nm is only a few tenths of a percent: round-trip loss must stay well below gain for oscillation, and low scatter also directly lowers the lock-in threshold.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"光學接觸面若殘留微粒或濕氣，接觸會在溫度循環中局部脫開，鏡面角度跳動數 µrad，使模態橫向偏移、損耗突增而熄振；用黏膠補救則引入潛變與除氣污染鏡面。","textEn":"Residual particles or moisture at an optical contact let the contact partially release under thermal cycling, the mirror angle jumps by microradians, the mode walks laterally, loss spikes and the laser extinguishes; gluing as a remedy brings creep and outgassing that contaminates the mirrors.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低膨脹腔體、鏡面損耗與增益餘裕」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Low-expansion block, mirror loss and gain margin\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["光學接觸面若殘留微粒或濕氣，接觸會在溫度循環中局部脫開，鏡面角度跳動數 µrad，使模態橫向偏移、損耗突增而熄振；用黏膠補救則引入潛變與除氣污染鏡面。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。"],"optionsEn":["Residual particles or moisture at an optical contact let the contact partially release under thermal cycling, the mirror angle jumps by microradians, the mode walks laterally, loss spikes and the laser extinguishes.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias."],"answer":0,"explanation":"光學接觸面若殘留微粒或濕氣，接觸會在溫度循環中局部脫開，鏡面角度跳動數 µrad，使模態橫向偏移、損耗突增而熄振；用黏膠補救則引入潛變與除氣污染鏡面。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Residual particles or moisture at an optical contact let the contact partially release under thermal cycling, the mirror angle jumps by microradians, the mode walks laterally, loss spikes and the laser extinguishes; gluing as a remedy brings creep and outgassing that contaminates the mirrors. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a438-v12-13","title":"增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「對稱放電與路徑長度控制」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Symmetric discharge and path-length control” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"腔內以直流放電激發 He-Ne 混合氣，一個陰極配兩個對稱的陽極，使兩段放電的氣體流動方向相反而相互抵消；放電中離子拖動中性氣體產生的 Langmuir 流會透過 Fresnel 拖曳效應讓兩方向光速不同，若不對稱就變成假旋轉。氖氣採用 Ne-20 與 Ne-22 約等比例混合，使兩同位素的增益峰錯開，避免兩反向模態在同一組原子上競爭而互相熄滅。路徑長度控制以壓電驅動一面鏡子，鎖住總光強最大的腔長，使雷射始終工作在增益曲線中心。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「對稱放電與路徑長度控制」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A dc discharge excites the He-Ne mixture with one cathode and two symmetric anodes so that gas flow in the two discharge legs runs in opposite directions and cancels; ions dragging neutral gas produce Langmuir flow, and through Fresnel drag the two beams then see different light speeds, which reads as false rotation if asymmetric. Neon is a near-equal mix of Ne-20 and Ne-22 so the isotopes' gain peaks are offset and the two counter-propagating modes do not compete for the same atoms and quench each other. Path-length control drives one mirror with a piezo to hold the cavity length at maximum total intensity, keeping the laser at the centre of the gain curve. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Symmetric discharge and path-length control”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Fresnel 拖曳的光程差 Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c，對應拍頻 Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Fresnel-drag optical-path difference is Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c and the resulting beat is Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL).","failure":"常見誤解：「只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「對稱放電與路徑長度控制」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Symmetric discharge and path-length control”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-13-k1","title":"增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制","titleEn":"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control","text":"腔內以直流放電激發 He-Ne 混合氣，一個陰極配兩個對稱的陽極，使兩段放電的氣體流動方向相反而相互抵消；放電中離子拖動中性氣體產生的 Langmuir 流會透過 Fresnel 拖曳效應讓兩方向光速不同，若不對稱就變成假旋轉。氖氣採用 Ne-20 與 Ne-22 約等比例混合，使兩同位素的增益峰錯開，避免兩反向模態在同一組原子上競爭而互相熄滅。","textEn":"A dc discharge excites the He-Ne mixture with one cathode and two symmetric anodes so that gas flow in the two discharge legs runs in opposite directions and cancels; ions dragging neutral gas produce Langmuir flow, and through Fresnel drag the two beams then see different light speeds, which reads as false rotation if asymmetric. Neon is a near-equal mix of Ne-20 and Ne-22 so the isotopes' gain peaks are offset and the two counter-propagating modes do not compete for the same atoms and quench each other.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control\" is correct?","options":["只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。","腔內以直流放電激發 He-Ne 混合氣，一個陰極配兩個對稱的陽極，使兩段放電的氣體流動方向相反而相互抵消。","比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias.","A dc discharge excites the He-Ne mixture with one cathode and two symmetric anodes so that gas flow in the two discharge legs runs in opposite directions and cancels.","Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration."],"answer":1,"explanation":"腔內以直流放電激發 He-Ne 混合氣，一個陰極配兩個對稱的陽極，使兩段放電的氣體流動方向相反而相互抵消；放電中離子拖動中性氣體產生的 Langmuir 流會透過 Fresnel 拖曳效應讓兩方向光速不同，若不對稱就變成假旋轉。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A dc discharge excites the He-Ne mixture with one cathode and two symmetric anodes so that gas flow in the two discharge legs runs in opposite directions and cancels; ions dragging neutral gas produce Langmuir flow, and through Fresnel drag the two beams then see different light speeds, which reads as false rotation if asymmetric. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a438-v12-14","title":"增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制：定量估算","titleEn":"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「對稱放電與路徑長度控制」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Symmetric discharge and path-length control” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Fresnel 拖曳的光程差 Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c，對應拍頻 Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL)。教學假設放電段長 l = 0.10 m、低壓氣體 n − 1 = 2.3×10⁻⁷、殘餘不對稱流速 v = 0.1 m/s：Δ_opt ≈ 3.1×10⁻¹⁷ m，Δf ≈ 0.048 Hz，除以 S = 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s) 得假旋轉 5.3×10⁻⁷ rad/s ≈ 0.11 °/h，已是導航級零偏規格（0.01 °/h）的 10 倍，因此放電對稱性必須控制到 1% 以下。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Fresnel-drag optical-path difference is Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c and the resulting beat is Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL). Teaching assumptions: discharge leg l = 0.10 m, low-pressure gas with n − 1 = 2.3×10⁻⁷, residual asymmetric flow v = 0.1 m/s: Δ_opt ≈ 3.1×10⁻¹⁷ m, Δf ≈ 0.048 Hz, and dividing by S = 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s) gives a false rotation of 5.3×10⁻⁷ rad/s ≈ 0.11 °/h, ten times a navigation-grade bias specification of 0.01 °/h, so discharge symmetry must be held below 1%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：靜態下交替改變兩陽極的電流分配（例如 ±2%），記錄零偏隨電流差的斜率，就得到流動不對稱的靈敏度係數；再掃描路徑長度控制的設定點，確認零偏與比例因子在增益曲線中心附近對腔長的敏感度最低，並把工作點鎖在那裡。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At rest, deliberately shift the current split between the two anodes (for example ±2%) and record the slope of bias against current imbalance to obtain the flow-asymmetry sensitivity; then sweep the path-length-control set point and confirm that bias and scale factor are least sensitive to cavity length near the gain-curve centre, locking the operating point there.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Fresnel 拖曳的光程差 Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c，對應拍頻 Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL)。教學假設放電段長 l = 0.10 m、低壓氣體 n − 1 = 2.3×10⁻⁷、殘餘不對稱流速 v = 0.1 m/s：Δ_opt ≈ 3.1×10⁻¹⁷ m，Δf ≈ 0.048 Hz，除以 S = 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s) 得假旋轉 5.3×10⁻⁷ rad/s ≈ 0.11 °/h，已是導航級零偏規格（0.01 °/h）的 10 倍，因此放電對稱性必須控制到 1% 以下。","textEn":"Fresnel-drag optical-path difference is Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c and the resulting beat is Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL). Teaching assumptions: discharge leg l = 0.10 m, low-pressure gas with n − 1 = 2.3×10⁻⁷, residual asymmetric flow v = 0.1 m/s: Δ_opt ≈ 3.1×10⁻¹⁷ m, Δf ≈ 0.048 Hz, and dividing by S = 9.12×10⁴ Hz/(rad/s) gives a false rotation of 5.3×10⁻⁷ rad/s ≈ 0.11 °/h, ten times a navigation-grade bias specification of 0.01 °/h, so discharge symmetry must be held below 1%.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control\", which statement holds?","options":["環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。","環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。","Fresnel 拖曳的光程差 Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c，對應拍頻 Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL)。"],"optionsEn":["A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing.","A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.","Fresnel-drag optical-path difference is Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c and the resulting beat is Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Fresnel 拖曳的光程差 Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c，對應拍頻 Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Fresnel-drag optical-path difference is Δ_opt = 2·l·(n² − 1)·v/c and the resulting beat is Δf = c·Δ_opt/(λL). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a438-v12-15","title":"增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「對稱放電與路徑長度控制」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Symmetric discharge and path-length control” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"靜態下交替改變兩陽極的電流分配（例如 ±2%），記錄零偏隨電流差的斜率，就得到流動不對稱的靈敏度係數；再掃描路徑長度控制的設定點，確認零偏與比例因子在增益曲線中心附近對腔長的敏感度最低，並把工作點鎖在那裡。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At rest, deliberately shift the current split between the two anodes (for example ±2%) and record the slope of bias against current imbalance to obtain the flow-asymmetry sensitivity; then sweep the path-length-control set point and confirm that bias and scale factor are least sensitive to cavity length near the gain-curve centre, locking the operating point there. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：陰極濺射把氣體吸入或 He 透過玻璃緩慢滲漏，使氣壓與同位素比例改變：增益下降、兩模態開始競爭而強度交替閃爍，零偏隨壓力漂移；路徑長度控制若鎖到旁邊的縱模，比例因子會跳一個離散值。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Cathode sputtering that pumps gas or slow helium permeation through the glass changes pressure and isotope ratio: gain falls, the two modes start competing and flicker alternately, and bias drifts with pressure; if path-length control locks onto an adjacent longitudinal mode, the scale factor jumps by a discrete step.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"靜態下交替改變兩陽極的電流分配（例如 ±2%），記錄零偏隨電流差的斜率，就得到流動不對稱的靈敏度係數；再掃描路徑長度控制的設定點，確認零偏與比例因子在增益曲線中心附近對腔長的敏感度最低，並把工作點鎖在那裡。","textEn":"At rest, deliberately shift the current split between the two anodes (for example ±2%) and record the slope of bias against current imbalance to obtain the flow-asymmetry sensitivity; then sweep the path-length-control set point and confirm that bias and scale factor are least sensitive to cavity length near the gain-curve centre, locking the operating point there.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control\"?","options":["靜態下交替改變兩陽極的電流分配（例如 ±2%），記錄零偏隨電流差的斜率，就得到流動不對稱的靈敏度係數。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。"],"optionsEn":["At rest, deliberately shift the current split between the two anodes (for example ±2%) and record the slope of bias against current imbalance to obtain the flow-asymmetry sensitivity.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates."],"answer":0,"explanation":"靜態下交替改變兩陽極的電流分配（例如 ±2%），記錄零偏隨電流差的斜率，就得到流動不對稱的靈敏度係數；再掃描路徑長度控制的設定點，確認零偏與比例因子在增益曲線中心附近對腔長的敏感度最低，並把工作點鎖在那裡。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"At rest, deliberately shift the current split between the two anodes (for example ±2%) and record the slope of bias against current imbalance to obtain the flow-asymmetry sensitivity; then sweep the path-length-control set point and confirm that bias and scale factor are least sensitive to cavity length near the gain-curve centre, locking the operating point there. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a438-v12-16","title":"增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「對稱放電與路徑長度控制」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Symmetric discharge and path-length control” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"陰極濺射把氣體吸入或 He 透過玻璃緩慢滲漏，使氣壓與同位素比例改變：增益下降、兩模態開始競爭而強度交替閃爍，零偏隨壓力漂移；路徑長度控制若鎖到旁邊的縱模，比例因子會跳一個離散值。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Cathode sputtering that pumps gas or slow helium permeation through the glass changes pressure and isotope ratio: gain falls, the two modes start competing and flicker alternately, and bias drifts with pressure; if path-length control locks onto an adjacent longitudinal mode, the scale factor jumps by a discrete step. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：路徑長度控制以壓電驅動一面鏡子，鎖住總光強最大的腔長，使雷射始終工作在增益曲線中心。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Path-length control drives one mirror with a piezo to hold the cavity length at maximum total intensity, keeping the laser at the centre of the gain curve.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"陰極濺射把氣體吸入或 He 透過玻璃緩慢滲漏，使氣壓與同位素比例改變：增益下降、兩模態開始競爭而強度交替閃爍，零偏隨壓力漂移；路徑長度控制若鎖到旁邊的縱模，比例因子會跳一個離散值。","textEn":"Cathode sputtering that pumps gas or slow helium permeation through the glass changes pressure and isotope ratio: gain falls, the two modes start competing and flicker alternately, and bias drifts with pressure; if path-length control locks onto an adjacent longitudinal mode, the scale factor jumps by a discrete step.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「增益氣體、Langmuir 流與路徑長度控制」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gain gas, Langmuir flow and path-length control\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","陰極濺射把氣體吸入或 He 透過玻璃緩慢滲漏，使氣壓與同位素比例改變：增益下降、兩模態開始競爭而強度交替閃爍，零偏隨壓力漂移。","比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Cathode sputtering that pumps gas or slow helium permeation through the glass changes pressure and isotope ratio: gain falls, the two modes start competing and flicker alternately, and bias drifts with pressure.","Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration."],"answer":1,"explanation":"陰極濺射把氣體吸入或 He 透過玻璃緩慢滲漏，使氣壓與同位素比例改變：增益下降、兩模態開始競爭而強度交替閃爍，零偏隨壓力漂移；路徑長度控制若鎖到旁邊的縱模，比例因子會跳一個離散值。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Cathode sputtering that pumps gas or slow helium permeation through the glass changes pressure and isotope ratio: gain falls, the two modes start competing and flicker alternately, and bias drifts with pressure; if path-length control locks onto an adjacent longitudinal mode, the scale factor jumps by a discrete step. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a438-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出」與「零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout\" and \"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a438-v12-17","title":"比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「速率轉台與正交讀出」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Rate table and quadrature readout” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"合光稜鏡讓兩道輸出光以極小夾角重疊，形成空間條紋，兩個相隔四分之一條紋的光電二極體給出正交訊號，條紋移動方向決定旋轉方向，每個條紋邊緣都可計數，四倍解碼後角度解析度是條紋週期的四分之一。比例因子的校正在速率轉台上進行：轉台用自身的角度編碼器提供整數圈的精確轉角，陀螺儀累計的計數除以轉角就是 S，再分別在正反轉、不同速率與溫度下重複，建立比例因子的線性度與溫度係數表。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「速率轉台與正交讀出」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The combining prism overlaps the two output beams at a tiny angle to form spatial fringes; two photodiodes a quarter fringe apart give quadrature signals, the direction of fringe motion gives the sign of rotation, every fringe edge can be counted, and fourfold decoding resolves a quarter of a fringe period. Scale factor is calibrated on a rate table whose own angle encoder provides exact whole-turn angles: accumulated gyro counts divided by the table angle give S, repeated in both directions, at several rates and temperatures, to build linearity and temperature-coefficient tables. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Rate table and quadrature readout”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：轉台以 100 °/s 轉 100 s，轉角 10,000° = 174.53 rad，理想計數 N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ 條紋；若 S 有 5 ppm 誤差，計數差 ≈ 80 條紋，乘以 2.26 arcsec/條紋 ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Rotate the table at 100 °/s for 100 s: 10,000° = 174.53 rad, ideal count N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ fringes; a 5 ppm error in S changes the count by ≈ 80 fringes, which at 2.26 arcsec per fringe is ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°.","failure":"常見誤解：「比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「速率轉台與正交讀出」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Rate table and quadrature readout”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-17-k1","title":"比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出","titleEn":"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout","text":"合光稜鏡讓兩道輸出光以極小夾角重疊，形成空間條紋，兩個相隔四分之一條紋的光電二極體給出正交訊號，條紋移動方向決定旋轉方向，每個條紋邊緣都可計數，四倍解碼後角度解析度是條紋週期的四分之一。比例因子的校正在速率轉台上進行：轉台用自身的角度編碼器提供整數圈的精確轉角，陀螺儀累計的計數除以轉角就是 S，再分別在正反轉、不同速率與溫度下重複，建立比例因子的線性度與溫度係數表。","textEn":"The combining prism overlaps the two output beams at a tiny angle to form spatial fringes; two photodiodes a quarter fringe apart give quadrature signals, the direction of fringe motion gives the sign of rotation, every fringe edge can be counted, and fourfold decoding resolves a quarter of a fringe period. Scale factor is calibrated on a rate table whose own angle encoder provides exact whole-turn angles: accumulated gyro counts divided by the table angle give S, repeated in both directions, at several rates and temperatures, to build linearity and temperature-coefficient tables.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout\" is correct?","options":["比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。","平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。","合光稜鏡讓兩道輸出光以極小夾角重疊，形成空間條紋，兩個相隔四分之一條紋的光電二極體給出正交訊號，條紋移動方向決定旋轉方向，每個條紋邊緣都可計數，四倍解碼後角度解析度是條紋週期的四分之一。"],"optionsEn":["Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration.","Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller.","The combining prism overlaps the two output beams at a tiny angle to form spatial fringes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"合光稜鏡讓兩道輸出光以極小夾角重疊，形成空間條紋，兩個相隔四分之一條紋的光電二極體給出正交訊號，條紋移動方向決定旋轉方向，每個條紋邊緣都可計數，四倍解碼後角度解析度是條紋週期的四分之一。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The combining prism overlaps the two output beams at a tiny angle to form spatial fringes; two photodiodes a quarter fringe apart give quadrature signals, the direction of fringe motion gives the sign of rotation, every fringe edge can be counted, and fourfold decoding resolves a quarter of a fringe period. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a438-v12-18","title":"比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出：定量估算","titleEn":"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「速率轉台與正交讀出」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Rate table and quadrature readout” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：轉台以 100 °/s 轉 100 s，轉角 10,000° = 174.53 rad，理想計數 N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ 條紋；若 S 有 5 ppm 誤差，計數差 ≈ 80 條紋，乘以 2.26 arcsec/條紋 ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°。四倍正交解碼後單次讀出量化誤差為 2.26/4 ≈ 0.57 arcsec，對校正結果可忽略，但比例因子要校到 1 ppm 需要轉台角度本身優於 0.036 arcsec/10,000°。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Rotate the table at 100 °/s for 100 s: 10,000° = 174.53 rad, ideal count N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ fringes; a 5 ppm error in S changes the count by ≈ 80 fringes, which at 2.26 arcsec per fringe is ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°. After fourfold quadrature decoding the single-readout quantisation is 2.26/4 ≈ 0.57 arcsec, negligible for calibration, but calibrating S to 1 ppm needs the table angle itself to be good to 0.036 arcsec over 10,000°. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以整數圈（例如 ±10 圈）為單位校正，避免轉台編碼器的週期誤差；比較正轉與反轉算出的 S，差值反映讀出的方向不對稱或抖動剝除殘餘；在 −40 到 +70 °C 間重複，擬合 S 的溫度係數（ppm/K）並寫進補償表，最後用獨立的多面稜鏡加自準直儀交叉驗證轉台角度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate on whole turns (for example ±10 turns) to cancel encoder periodic error; compare S from forward and reverse runs, whose difference exposes readout direction asymmetry or residual dither stripping; repeat between −40 and +70 °C, fit the temperature coefficient of S in ppm/K into the compensation table, and cross-check the table angle with an independent polygon mirror and autocollimator.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"轉台以 100 °/s 轉 100 s，轉角 10,000° = 174.53 rad，理想計數 N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ 條紋；若 S 有 5 ppm 誤差，計數差 ≈ 80 條紋，乘以 2.26 arcsec/條紋 ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°。四倍正交解碼後單次讀出量化誤差為 2.26/4 ≈ 0.57 arcsec，對校正結果可忽略，但比例因子要校到 1 ppm 需要轉台角度本身優於 0.036 arcsec/10,000°。","textEn":"Rotate the table at 100 °/s for 100 s: 10,000° = 174.53 rad, ideal count N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ fringes; a 5 ppm error in S changes the count by ≈ 80 fringes, which at 2.26 arcsec per fringe is ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°. After fourfold quadrature decoding the single-readout quantisation is 2.26/4 ≈ 0.57 arcsec, negligible for calibration, but calibrating S to 1 ppm needs the table angle itself to be good to 0.036 arcsec over 10,000°.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout\", which statement holds?","options":["轉台以 100 °/s 轉 100 s，轉角 10,000° = 174.53 rad，理想計數 N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ 條紋。","陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。","鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。"],"optionsEn":["Rotate the table at 100 °/s for 100 s: 10,000° = 174.53 rad, ideal count N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ fringes.","Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time.","Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates."],"answer":0,"explanation":"轉台以 100 °/s 轉 100 s，轉角 10,000° = 174.53 rad，理想計數 N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ 條紋；若 S 有 5 ppm 誤差，計數差 ≈ 80 條紋，乘以 2.26 arcsec/條紋 ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Rotate the table at 100 °/s for 100 s: 10,000° = 174.53 rad, ideal count N = S·θ = 9.12×10⁴×174.53 ≈ 1.59×10⁷ fringes; a 5 ppm error in S changes the count by ≈ 80 fringes, which at 2.26 arcsec per fringe is ≈ 180 arcsec = 0.05°. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a438-v12-19","title":"比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「速率轉台與正交讀出」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Rate table and quadrature readout” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以整數圈（例如 ±10 圈）為單位校正，避免轉台編碼器的週期誤差；比較正轉與反轉算出的 S，差值反映讀出的方向不對稱或抖動剝除殘餘；在 −40 到 +70 °C 間重複，擬合 S 的溫度係數（ppm/K）並寫進補償表，最後用獨立的多面稜鏡加自準直儀交叉驗證轉台角度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate on whole turns (for example ±10 turns) to cancel encoder periodic error; compare S from forward and reverse runs, whose difference exposes readout direction asymmetry or residual dither stripping; repeat between −40 and +70 °C, fit the temperature coefficient of S in ppm/K into the compensation table, and cross-check the table angle with an independent polygon mirror and autocollimator. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：光電二極體正交相位偏離 90° 或兩路增益不等時，解碼器在高速下漏計或多計邊緣，比例因子看似與速率有關；若把這種讀出錯誤當成光學非線性去補償，換一個轉台速率就又不對。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Quadrature phase off 90° or unequal channel gains make the decoder miss or double-count edges at high rate, so the scale factor appears rate dependent; compensating this readout fault as optical non-linearity fails as soon as the table rate changes.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以整數圈（例如 ±10 圈）為單位校正，避免轉台編碼器的週期誤差；比較正轉與反轉算出的 S，差值反映讀出的方向不對稱或抖動剝除殘餘；在 −40 到 +70 °C 間重複，擬合 S 的溫度係數（ppm/K）並寫進補償表，最後用獨立的多面稜鏡加自準直儀交叉驗證轉台角度。","textEn":"Calibrate on whole turns (for example ±10 turns) to cancel encoder periodic error; compare S from forward and reverse runs, whose difference exposes readout direction asymmetry or residual dither stripping; repeat between −40 and +70 °C, fit the temperature coefficient of S in ppm/K into the compensation table, and cross-check the table angle with an independent polygon mirror and autocollimator.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以整數圈（例如 ±10 圈）為單位校正，避免轉台編碼器的週期誤差。","普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Calibrate on whole turns (for example ±10 turns) to cancel encoder periodic error.","An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以整數圈（例如 ±10 圈）為單位校正，避免轉台編碼器的週期誤差；比較正轉與反轉算出的 S，差值反映讀出的方向不對稱或抖動剝除殘餘；在 −40 到 +70 °C 間重複，擬合 S 的溫度係數（ppm/K）並寫進補償表，最後用獨立的多面稜鏡加自準直儀交叉驗證轉台角度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate on whole turns (for example ±10 turns) to cancel encoder periodic error; compare S from forward and reverse runs, whose difference exposes readout direction asymmetry or residual dither stripping; repeat between −40 and +70 °C, fit the temperature coefficient of S in ppm/K into the compensation table, and cross-check the table angle with an independent polygon mirror and autocollimator. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a438-v12-20","title":"比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「速率轉台與正交讀出」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Rate table and quadrature readout” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"光電二極體正交相位偏離 90° 或兩路增益不等時，解碼器在高速下漏計或多計邊緣，比例因子看似與速率有關；若把這種讀出錯誤當成光學非線性去補償，換一個轉台速率就又不對。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Quadrature phase off 90° or unequal channel gains make the decoder miss or double-count edges at high rate, so the scale factor appears rate dependent; compensating this readout fault as optical non-linearity fails as soon as the table rate changes. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：比例因子的校正在速率轉台上進行：轉台用自身的角度編碼器提供整數圈的精確轉角，陀螺儀累計的計數除以轉角就是 S，再分別在正反轉、不同速率與溫度下重複，建立比例因子的線性度與溫度係數表。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Scale factor is calibrated on a rate table whose own angle encoder provides exact whole-turn angles: accumulated gyro counts divided by the table angle give S, repeated in both directions, at several rates and temperatures, to build linearity and temperature-coefficient tables.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"光電二極體正交相位偏離 90° 或兩路增益不等時，解碼器在高速下漏計或多計邊緣，比例因子看似與速率有關；若把這種讀出錯誤當成光學非線性去補償，換一個轉台速率就又不對。","textEn":"Quadrature phase off 90° or unequal channel gains make the decoder miss or double-count edges at high rate, so the scale factor appears rate dependent; compensating this readout fault as optical non-linearity fails as soon as the table rate changes.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「比例因子校正與條紋計數讀出」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scale-factor calibration and fringe-counting readout\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。","光電二極體正交相位偏離 90° 或兩路增益不等時，解碼器在高速下漏計或多計邊緣，比例因子看似與速率有關。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller.","Quadrature phase off 90° or unequal channel gains make the decoder miss or double-count edges at high rate, so the scale factor appears rate dependent."],"answer":2,"explanation":"光電二極體正交相位偏離 90° 或兩路增益不等時，解碼器在高速下漏計或多計邊緣，比例因子看似與速率有關；若把這種讀出錯誤當成光學非線性去補償，換一個轉台速率就又不對。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Quadrature phase off 90° or unequal channel gains make the decoder miss or double-count edges at high rate, so the scale factor appears rate dependent; compensating this readout fault as optical non-linearity fails as soon as the table rate changes. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a438-v12-21","title":"零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「Allan 偏差曲線」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Allan-deviation curve” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"靜態長時間資料的 Allan 偏差把雜訊按時間尺度拆開：短平均時間下斜率 −1/2 的段落是白雜訊角速率，即角度隨機漫步 ARW；曲線底部的平坦段是零偏不穩定度，來自放電、溫度與磁場的慢變；更長時間若斜率轉為 +1/2，是速率隨機漫步或溫度趨勢。導航級規格通常要求零偏不穩定度 0.01 °/h 等級、ARW 0.005 °/√h 等級，並把各項按均方根合成，再換算成航向與位置誤差。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Allan 偏差曲線」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An Allan deviation of long static data separates noise by time scale: the slope −1/2 segment at short averaging times is white rate noise, the angle random walk ARW; the flat floor is bias instability from slow discharge, temperature and magnetic changes; a later rise with slope +1/2 is rate random walk or a temperature trend. Navigation-grade specifications typically ask for bias instability of order 0.01 °/h and ARW of order 0.005 °/√h, combined root-sum-square and converted into heading and position error. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Allan-deviation curve”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：白雜訊段 σ(τ) = ARW/√τ（τ 以小時計）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: White-noise segment σ(τ) = ARW/√τ with τ in hours.","failure":"常見誤解：「平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Allan 偏差曲線」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Allan-deviation curve”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-21-k1","title":"零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算","titleEn":"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget","text":"靜態長時間資料的 Allan 偏差把雜訊按時間尺度拆開：短平均時間下斜率 −1/2 的段落是白雜訊角速率，即角度隨機漫步 ARW；曲線底部的平坦段是零偏不穩定度，來自放電、溫度與磁場的慢變；更長時間若斜率轉為 +1/2，是速率隨機漫步或溫度趨勢。導航級規格通常要求零偏不穩定度 0.01 °/h 等級、ARW 0.005 °/√h 等級，並把各項按均方根合成，再換算成航向與位置誤差。","textEn":"An Allan deviation of long static data separates noise by time scale: the slope −1/2 segment at short averaging times is white rate noise, the angle random walk ARW; the flat floor is bias instability from slow discharge, temperature and magnetic changes; a later rise with slope +1/2 is rate random walk or a temperature trend. Navigation-grade specifications typically ask for bias instability of order 0.01 °/h and ARW of order 0.005 °/√h, combined root-sum-square and converted into heading and position error.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget\" is correct?","options":["靜態長時間資料的 Allan 偏差把雜訊按時間尺度拆開：短平均時間下斜率 −1/2 的段落是白雜訊角速率，即角度隨機漫步 ARW。","平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。","環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。"],"optionsEn":["An Allan deviation of long static data separates noise by time scale: the slope −1/2 segment at short averaging times is white rate noise, the angle random walk ARW.","Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller.","A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"靜態長時間資料的 Allan 偏差把雜訊按時間尺度拆開：短平均時間下斜率 −1/2 的段落是白雜訊角速率，即角度隨機漫步 ARW；曲線底部的平坦段是零偏不穩定度，來自放電、溫度與磁場的慢變；更長時間若斜率轉為 +1/2，是速率隨機漫步或溫度趨勢。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An Allan deviation of long static data separates noise by time scale: the slope −1/2 segment at short averaging times is white rate noise, the angle random walk ARW; the flat floor is bias instability from slow discharge, temperature and magnetic changes; a later rise with slope +1/2 is rate random walk or a temperature trend. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a438-v12-22","title":"零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Allan 偏差曲線」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Allan-deviation curve” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：白雜訊段 σ(τ) = ARW/√τ（τ 以小時計）。取 ARW = 0.005 °/√h：τ = 1 s 時 σ = 0.005/√(1/3600) = 0.30 °/h；τ = 100 s 時 0.030 °/h；τ = 1000 s 時 0.0095 °/h，之後被 0.003 °/h 的零偏不穩定度底部截斷。航向預算：零偏 0.01 °/h 在 1 h 內累積 0.01° = 1.75×10⁻⁴ rad，以 500 km 航程計橫向位置誤差約 87 m，這是純陀螺項，尚未含加速度計與對準誤差。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: White-noise segment σ(τ) = ARW/√τ with τ in hours. For ARW = 0.005 °/√h: at τ = 1 s, σ = 0.005/√(1/3600) = 0.30 °/h; at τ = 100 s, 0.030 °/h; at τ = 1000 s, 0.0095 °/h, after which a 0.003 °/h bias-instability floor takes over. Heading budget: a 0.01 °/h bias accumulates 0.01° = 1.75×10⁻⁴ rad in 1 h, about 87 m of cross-track error over 500 km, the pure gyro term before accelerometer and alignment errors. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在溫度穩定的靜態平台上連續記錄至少 12 小時，計算重疊 Allan 偏差並辨認 −1/2、0、+1/2 三段，讀出 ARW 與零偏不穩定度；同時記錄溫度與放電電流，用回歸找出零偏對溫度的靈敏度（°/h/K），補償後重算 Allan 偏差，確認底部下降而短時段不變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record at least 12 hours continuously on a temperature-stable static platform, compute the overlapping Allan deviation, identify the −1/2, 0 and +1/2 segments and read ARW and bias instability; log temperature and discharge current in parallel, regress the bias temperature sensitivity in °/h per K, compensate and recompute to confirm the floor drops while the short-τ segment is unchanged.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"白雜訊段 σ(τ) = ARW/√τ（τ 以小時計）。取 ARW = 0.005 °/√h：τ = 1 s 時 σ = 0.005/√(1/3600) = 0.30 °/h；τ = 100 s 時 0.030 °/h；τ = 1000 s 時 0.0095 °/h，之後被 0.003 °/h 的零偏不穩定度底部截斷。航向預算：零偏 0.01 °/h 在 1 h 內累積 0.01° = 1.75×10⁻⁴ rad，以 500 km 航程計橫向位置誤差約 87 m，這是純陀螺項，尚未含加速度計與對準誤差。","textEn":"White-noise segment σ(τ) = ARW/√τ with τ in hours. For ARW = 0.005 °/√h: at τ = 1 s, σ = 0.005/√(1/3600) = 0.30 °/h; at τ = 100 s, 0.030 °/h; at τ = 1000 s, 0.0095 °/h, after which a 0.003 °/h bias-instability floor takes over. Heading budget: a 0.01 °/h bias accumulates 0.01° = 1.75×10⁻⁴ rad in 1 h, about 87 m of cross-track error over 500 km, the pure gyro term before accelerometer and alignment errors.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。","白雜訊段 σ(τ) = ARW/√τ（τ 以小時計）。","普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。"],"optionsEn":["A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.","White-noise segment σ(τ) = ARW/√τ with τ in hours.","An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate."],"answer":1,"explanation":"白雜訊段 σ(τ) = ARW/√τ（τ 以小時計）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"White-noise segment σ(τ) = ARW/√τ with τ in hours. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a438-v12-23","title":"零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Allan 偏差曲線」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Allan-deviation curve” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在溫度穩定的靜態平台上連續記錄至少 12 小時，計算重疊 Allan 偏差並辨認 −1/2、0、+1/2 三段，讀出 ARW 與零偏不穩定度；同時記錄溫度與放電電流，用回歸找出零偏對溫度的靈敏度（°/h/K），補償後重算 Allan 偏差，確認底部下降而短時段不變。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record at least 12 hours continuously on a temperature-stable static platform, compute the overlapping Allan deviation, identify the −1/2, 0 and +1/2 segments and read ARW and bias instability; log temperature and discharge current in parallel, regress the bias temperature sensitivity in °/h per K, compensate and recompute to confirm the floor drops while the short-τ segment is unchanged. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用太短的資料集算 Allan 偏差，長 τ 的點只有幾個樣本，底部被低估，交付的零偏不穩定度比真實值好一個因子二；在飛行中這會以航向緩慢漂移的形式出現，而使用者以為是對準問題。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Allan deviation from too short a record has only a few samples at long τ, the floor is underestimated and the delivered bias instability is a factor of two optimistic; in flight it appears as slow heading drift that the user mistakes for an alignment problem.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在溫度穩定的靜態平台上連續記錄至少 12 小時，計算重疊 Allan 偏差並辨認 −1/2、0、+1/2 三段，讀出 ARW 與零偏不穩定度；同時記錄溫度與放電電流，用回歸找出零偏對溫度的靈敏度（°/h/K），補償後重算 Allan 偏差，確認底部下降而短時段不變。","textEn":"Record at least 12 hours continuously on a temperature-stable static platform, compute the overlapping Allan deviation, identify the −1/2, 0 and +1/2 segments and read ARW and bias instability; log temperature and discharge current in parallel, regress the bias temperature sensitivity in °/h per K, compensate and recompute to confirm the floor drops while the short-τ segment is unchanged.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。","在溫度穩定的靜態平台上連續記錄至少 12 小時，計算重疊 Allan 偏差並辨認 −1/2、0、+1/2 三段，讀出 ARW 與零偏不穩定度。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias.","Record at least 12 hours continuously on a temperature-stable static platform, compute the overlapping Allan deviation, identify the −1/2, 0 and +1/2 segments and read ARW and bias instability."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在溫度穩定的靜態平台上連續記錄至少 12 小時，計算重疊 Allan 偏差並辨認 −1/2、0、+1/2 三段，讀出 ARW 與零偏不穩定度；同時記錄溫度與放電電流，用回歸找出零偏對溫度的靈敏度（°/h/K），補償後重算 Allan 偏差，確認底部下降而短時段不變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record at least 12 hours continuously on a temperature-stable static platform, compute the overlapping Allan deviation, identify the −1/2, 0 and +1/2 segments and read ARW and bias instability; log temperature and discharge current in parallel, regress the bias temperature sensitivity in °/h per K, compensate and recompute to confirm the floor drops while the short-τ segment is unchanged. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a438-v12-24","title":"零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Allan 偏差曲線」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Allan-deviation curve” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用太短的資料集算 Allan 偏差，長 τ 的點只有幾個樣本，底部被低估，交付的零偏不穩定度比真實值好一個因子二；在飛行中這會以航向緩慢漂移的形式出現，而使用者以為是對準問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Allan deviation from too short a record has only a few samples at long τ, the floor is underestimated and the delivered bias instability is a factor of two optimistic; in flight it appears as slow heading drift that the user mistakes for an alignment problem. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：導航級規格通常要求零偏不穩定度 0.01 °/h 等級、ARW 0.005 °/√h 等級，並把各項按均方根合成，再換算成航向與位置誤差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Navigation-grade specifications typically ask for bias instability of order 0.01 °/h and ARW of order 0.005 °/√h, combined root-sum-square and converted into heading and position error.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用太短的資料集算 Allan 偏差，長 τ 的點只有幾個樣本，底部被低估，交付的零偏不穩定度比真實值好一個因子二；在飛行中這會以航向緩慢漂移的形式出現，而使用者以為是對準問題。","textEn":"Allan deviation from too short a record has only a few samples at long τ, the floor is underestimated and the delivered bias instability is a factor of two optimistic; in flight it appears as slow heading drift that the user mistakes for an alignment problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「零偏、隨機漫步與導航級誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Bias, random walk and the navigation-grade error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["用太短的資料集算 Allan 偏差，長 τ 的點只有幾個樣本，底部被低估，交付的零偏不穩定度比真實值好一個因子二。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。"],"optionsEn":["Allan deviation from too short a record has only a few samples at long τ, the floor is underestimated and the delivered bias instability is a factor of two optimistic.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用太短的資料集算 Allan 偏差，長 τ 的點只有幾個樣本，底部被低估，交付的零偏不穩定度比真實值好一個因子二；在飛行中這會以航向緩慢漂移的形式出現，而使用者以為是對準問題。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Allan deviation from too short a record has only a few samples at long τ, the floor is underestimated and the delivered bias instability is a factor of two optimistic; in flight it appears as slow heading drift that the user mistakes for an alignment problem. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a438-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正」與「陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment\" and \"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a438-v12-25","title":"慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「三軸抖動座與誤準矩陣」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Three-axis dithered mount and misalignment matrix” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"三顆環形雷射陀螺儀與三顆加速度計裝在一個共用的感測器座上，輸入軸互相正交；每顆陀螺儀各自有抖動撓性件，抖動頻率刻意錯開數十赫茲，避免互相拍頻並透過底座耦合成假訊號。整機的誤準矩陣（非正交與相對於外殼基準面的旋轉）在多位置、多速率測試中解算，與比例因子、零偏一起寫入補償韌體；環形雷射陀螺儀對加速度不敏感，是它優於機械陀螺的關鍵，但抖動座的共振與振動整流仍必須在整機層級驗證。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「三軸抖動座與誤準矩陣」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Three ring-laser gyros and three accelerometers sit on one shared sensor mount with mutually orthogonal input axes; each gyro has its own dither flexure and the dither frequencies are deliberately staggered by tens of hertz so they do not beat against each other and couple through the base as false signals. The unit's misalignment matrix (non-orthogonality and rotation relative to the housing reference faces) is solved from multi-position, multi-rate tests and written into compensation firmware alongside scale factors and biases; insensitivity to acceleration is the ring-laser gyro's key advantage over spinning-mass gyros, but dither-mount resonances and vibration rectification must still be verified at unit level. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Three-axis dithered mount and misalignment matrix”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若 Y 軸陀螺儀的輸入軸對 X 軸有 100 µrad 的非正交，則在 X 軸 100 °/s 的機動中 Y 軸多感測 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h，比零偏規格大三個數量級，所以誤準必須校正到 10 µrad 以下，殘餘 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h 再靠機動持續時間短而被平均。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If the Y gyro input axis is 100 µrad non-orthogonal to X, a 100 °/s manoeuvre about X leaks 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h into Y, three orders above the bias specification, so misalignment must be calibrated below 10 µrad, leaving 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h that is tolerable only because manoeuvres are short.","failure":"常見誤解：「環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「三軸抖動座與誤準矩陣」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Three-axis dithered mount and misalignment matrix”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-25-k1","title":"慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正","titleEn":"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment","text":"三顆環形雷射陀螺儀與三顆加速度計裝在一個共用的感測器座上，輸入軸互相正交；每顆陀螺儀各自有抖動撓性件，抖動頻率刻意錯開數十赫茲，避免互相拍頻並透過底座耦合成假訊號。整機的誤準矩陣（非正交與相對於外殼基準面的旋轉）在多位置、多速率測試中解算，與比例因子、零偏一起寫入補償韌體；環形雷射陀螺儀對加速度不敏感，是它優於機械陀螺的關鍵，但抖動座的共振與振動整流仍必須在整機層級驗證。","textEn":"Three ring-laser gyros and three accelerometers sit on one shared sensor mount with mutually orthogonal input axes; each gyro has its own dither flexure and the dither frequencies are deliberately staggered by tens of hertz so they do not beat against each other and couple through the base as false signals. The unit's misalignment matrix (non-orthogonality and rotation relative to the housing reference faces) is solved from multi-position, multi-rate tests and written into compensation firmware alongside scale factors and biases; insensitivity to acceleration is the ring-laser gyro's key advantage over spinning-mass gyros, but dither-mount resonances and vibration rectification must still be verified at unit level.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment\" is correct?","options":["環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。","三顆環形雷射陀螺儀與三顆加速度計裝在一個共用的感測器座上，輸入軸互相正交。","陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。"],"optionsEn":["A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing.","Three ring-laser gyros and three accelerometers sit on one shared sensor mount with mutually orthogonal input axes.","Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"三顆環形雷射陀螺儀與三顆加速度計裝在一個共用的感測器座上，輸入軸互相正交；每顆陀螺儀各自有抖動撓性件，抖動頻率刻意錯開數十赫茲，避免互相拍頻並透過底座耦合成假訊號。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Three ring-laser gyros and three accelerometers sit on one shared sensor mount with mutually orthogonal input axes; each gyro has its own dither flexure and the dither frequencies are deliberately staggered by tens of hertz so they do not beat against each other and couple through the base as false signals. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a438-v12-26","title":"慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「三軸抖動座與誤準矩陣」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Three-axis dithered mount and misalignment matrix” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若 Y 軸陀螺儀的輸入軸對 X 軸有 100 µrad 的非正交，則在 X 軸 100 °/s 的機動中 Y 軸多感測 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h，比零偏規格大三個數量級，所以誤準必須校正到 10 µrad 以下，殘餘 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h 再靠機動持續時間短而被平均。抖動頻率配置例：380、420、460 Hz，最小差 40 Hz，遠離 1 Hz 以下的導航頻帶。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If the Y gyro input axis is 100 µrad non-orthogonal to X, a 100 °/s manoeuvre about X leaks 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h into Y, three orders above the bias specification, so misalignment must be calibrated below 10 µrad, leaving 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h that is tolerable only because manoeuvres are short. Example dither allocation: 380, 420 and 460 Hz, a minimum spacing of 40 Hz, far from the sub-1 Hz navigation band. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在雙軸轉台上做六位置靜態測試與各軸正反向速率測試，用最小平方法解出 3×3 誤準矩陣與零偏；再以隨機振動台掃描 20 到 2000 Hz，監視每顆陀螺儀輸出中是否出現抖動差頻或底座共振引起的整流零偏，並確認補償後各軸交叉耦合小於 10 µrad。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run six-position static tests and forward/reverse rate tests about each axis on a two-axis table, solve the 3×3 misalignment matrix and biases by least squares; then sweep 20 to 2000 Hz random vibration and watch each gyro output for dither difference frequencies or base-resonance rectified bias, confirming cross-coupling below 10 µrad after compensation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若 Y 軸陀螺儀的輸入軸對 X 軸有 100 µrad 的非正交，則在 X 軸 100 °/s 的機動中 Y 軸多感測 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h，比零偏規格大三個數量級，所以誤準必須校正到 10 µrad 以下，殘餘 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h 再靠機動持續時間短而被平均。抖動頻率配置例：380、420、460 Hz，最小差 40 Hz，遠離 1 Hz 以下的導航頻帶。","textEn":"If the Y gyro input axis is 100 µrad non-orthogonal to X, a 100 °/s manoeuvre about X leaks 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h into Y, three orders above the bias specification, so misalignment must be calibrated below 10 µrad, leaving 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h that is tolerable only because manoeuvres are short. Example dither allocation: 380, 420 and 460 Hz, a minimum spacing of 40 Hz, far from the sub-1 Hz navigation band.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment\", which statement holds?","options":["鎖定只是靈敏度降低，用更高增益的放大器就能讀出小角速率。","只要氣體夠純，單一陽極的放電也不會產生零偏。","若 Y 軸陀螺儀的輸入軸對 X 軸有 100 µrad 的非正交，則在 X 軸 100 °/s 的機動中 Y 軸多感測 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h，比零偏規格大三個數量級，所以誤準必須校正到 10 µrad 以下，殘餘 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h 再靠機動持續時間短而被平均。"],"optionsEn":["Lock-in merely lowers sensitivity, so a higher-gain amplifier can still read small rates.","With pure enough gas, a single-anode discharge introduces no bias.","If the Y gyro input axis is 100 µrad non-orthogonal to X, a 100 °/s manoeuvre about X leaks 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h into Y, three orders above the bias specification, so misalignment must be calibrated below 10 µrad, leaving 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h that is tolerable only because manoeuvres are short."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若 Y 軸陀螺儀的輸入軸對 X 軸有 100 µrad 的非正交，則在 X 軸 100 °/s 的機動中 Y 軸多感測 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h，比零偏規格大三個數量級，所以誤準必須校正到 10 µrad 以下，殘餘 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h 再靠機動持續時間短而被平均。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If the Y gyro input axis is 100 µrad non-orthogonal to X, a 100 °/s manoeuvre about X leaks 1×10⁻⁴×100 = 0.01 °/s = 36 °/h into Y, three orders above the bias specification, so misalignment must be calibrated below 10 µrad, leaving 36 °/h×(10/100) = 3.6 °/h that is tolerable only because manoeuvres are short. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a438-v12-27","title":"慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「三軸抖動座與誤準矩陣」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Three-axis dithered mount and misalignment matrix” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在雙軸轉台上做六位置靜態測試與各軸正反向速率測試，用最小平方法解出 3×3 誤準矩陣與零偏；再以隨機振動台掃描 20 到 2000 Hz，監視每顆陀螺儀輸出中是否出現抖動差頻或底座共振引起的整流零偏，並確認補償後各軸交叉耦合小於 10 µrad。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run six-position static tests and forward/reverse rate tests about each axis on a two-axis table, solve the 3×3 misalignment matrix and biases by least squares; then sweep 20 to 2000 Hz random vibration and watch each gyro output for dither difference frequencies or base-resonance rectified bias, confirming cross-coupling below 10 µrad after compensation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：兩顆陀螺儀的抖動頻率因撓性件製造差異而接近到幾赫茲，差頻落進導航頻帶，卡爾曼濾波器把它當成真實角速率，姿態輸出出現週期性擺動；症狀只在三顆同時運轉時出現，單顆測試看不到。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Two gyros whose dither frequencies drift within a few hertz of each other through flexure manufacturing spread put their difference frequency inside the navigation band; the Kalman filter treats it as real rate and attitude output oscillates.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在雙軸轉台上做六位置靜態測試與各軸正反向速率測試，用最小平方法解出 3×3 誤準矩陣與零偏；再以隨機振動台掃描 20 到 2000 Hz，監視每顆陀螺儀輸出中是否出現抖動差頻或底座共振引起的整流零偏，並確認補償後各軸交叉耦合小於 10 µrad。","textEn":"Run six-position static tests and forward/reverse rate tests about each axis on a two-axis table, solve the 3×3 misalignment matrix and biases by least squares; then sweep 20 to 2000 Hz random vibration and watch each gyro output for dither difference frequencies or base-resonance rectified bias, confirming cross-coupling below 10 µrad after compensation.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment\"?","options":["在雙軸轉台上做六位置靜態測試與各軸正反向速率測試，用最小平方法解出 3×3 誤準矩陣與零偏。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["Run six-position static tests and forward/reverse rate tests about each axis on a two-axis table, solve the 3×3 misalignment matrix and biases by least squares.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在雙軸轉台上做六位置靜態測試與各軸正反向速率測試，用最小平方法解出 3×3 誤準矩陣與零偏；再以隨機振動台掃描 20 到 2000 Hz，監視每顆陀螺儀輸出中是否出現抖動差頻或底座共振引起的整流零偏，並確認補償後各軸交叉耦合小於 10 µrad。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run six-position static tests and forward/reverse rate tests about each axis on a two-axis table, solve the 3×3 misalignment matrix and biases by least squares; then sweep 20 to 2000 Hz random vibration and watch each gyro output for dither difference frequencies or base-resonance rectified bias, confirming cross-coupling below 10 µrad after compensation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a438-v12-28","title":"慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「三軸抖動座與誤準矩陣」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Three-axis dithered mount and misalignment matrix” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"兩顆陀螺儀的抖動頻率因撓性件製造差異而接近到幾赫茲，差頻落進導航頻帶，卡爾曼濾波器把它當成真實角速率，姿態輸出出現週期性擺動；症狀只在三顆同時運轉時出現，單顆測試看不到。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Two gyros whose dither frequencies drift within a few hertz of each other through flexure manufacturing spread put their difference frequency inside the navigation band; the Kalman filter treats it as real rate and attitude output oscillates. The symptom appears only with all three running and is invisible in single-gyro tests. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：整機的誤準矩陣（非正交與相對於外殼基準面的旋轉）在多位置、多速率測試中解算，與比例因子、零偏一起寫入補償韌體；環形雷射陀螺儀對加速度不敏感，是它優於機械陀螺的關鍵，但抖動座的共振與振動整流仍必須在整機層級驗證。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The unit's misalignment matrix (non-orthogonality and rotation relative to the housing reference faces) is solved from multi-position, multi-rate tests and written into compensation firmware alongside scale factors and biases; insensitivity to acceleration is the ring-laser gyro's key advantage over spinning-mass gyros, but dither-mount resonances and vibration rectification must still be verified at unit level.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「環形雷射陀螺儀沒有運動件，所以整機不需要振動測試。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A ring-laser gyro has no moving parts, so the assembled unit needs no vibration testing.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"兩顆陀螺儀的抖動頻率因撓性件製造差異而接近到幾赫茲，差頻落進導航頻帶，卡爾曼濾波器把它當成真實角速率，姿態輸出出現週期性擺動；症狀只在三顆同時運轉時出現，單顆測試看不到。","textEn":"Two gyros whose dither frequencies drift within a few hertz of each other through flexure manufacturing spread put their difference frequency inside the navigation band; the Kalman filter treats it as real rate and attitude output oscillates. The symptom appears only with all three running and is invisible in single-gyro tests.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「慣性量測單元整合與軸間誤準校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Inertial-measurement-unit integration and inter-axis misalignment\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","兩顆陀螺儀的抖動頻率因撓性件製造差異而接近到幾赫茲，差頻落進導航頻帶，卡爾曼濾波器把它當成真實角速率，姿態輸出出現週期性擺動。","陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Two gyros whose dither frequencies drift within a few hertz of each other through flexure manufacturing spread put their difference frequency inside the navigation band.","Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"兩顆陀螺儀的抖動頻率因撓性件製造差異而接近到幾赫茲，差頻落進導航頻帶，卡爾曼濾波器把它當成真實角速率，姿態輸出出現週期性擺動；症狀只在三顆同時運轉時出現，單顆測試看不到。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Two gyros whose dither frequencies drift within a few hertz of each other through flexure manufacturing spread put their difference frequency inside the navigation band; the Kalman filter treats it as real rate and attitude output oscillates. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a438-v12-29","title":"陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「陀螺羅經對準與驗收報告」如何決定環形雷射陀螺儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Gyrocompass alignment and acceptance record” determines the key performance of “Ring-laser gyroscopes”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"整機最嚴格的功能驗證是靜態陀螺羅經對準：單元只靠量到的地球自轉水平分量 Ω_E·cosφ 找出真北，航向誤差直接由水平軸的零偏與一段對準時間內的 ARW 平均決定，因此這一項同時檢驗零偏、隨機漫步與誤準。驗收還包括溫度循環、振動、衝擊與電磁相容後重複上述測試，並比較校正參數在試驗前後的漂移。交接文件必須含比例因子、零偏、誤準矩陣、溫度係數、Allan 偏差曲線與鎖定門檻，使用者才能設定濾波器與判斷可用壽命。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「陀螺羅經對準與驗收報告」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The most demanding functional check of the finished unit is static gyrocompass alignment: using only the measured horizontal Earth-rate component Ω_E·cosφ the unit finds true north, and the heading error follows directly from horizontal-axis bias and the ARW averaged over the alignment time, so this one test exercises bias, random walk and misalignment together. Acceptance repeats it after thermal cycling, vibration, shock and electromagnetic-compatibility exposure and compares calibration parameters before and after. The handoff package must contain scale factors, biases, misalignment matrix, temperature coefficients, Allan-deviation curves and lock-in thresholds so the user can tune filters and judge usable life. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Gyrocompass alignment and acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：航向誤差 δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Heading error δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ).","failure":"常見誤解：「陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「陀螺羅經對準與驗收報告」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Gyrocompass alignment and acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-29-k1","title":"陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接","titleEn":"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff","text":"整機最嚴格的功能驗證是靜態陀螺羅經對準：單元只靠量到的地球自轉水平分量 Ω_E·cosφ 找出真北，航向誤差直接由水平軸的零偏與一段對準時間內的 ARW 平均決定，因此這一項同時檢驗零偏、隨機漫步與誤準。驗收還包括溫度循環、振動、衝擊與電磁相容後重複上述測試，並比較校正參數在試驗前後的漂移。","textEn":"The most demanding functional check of the finished unit is static gyrocompass alignment: using only the measured horizontal Earth-rate component Ω_E·cosφ the unit finds true north, and the heading error follows directly from horizontal-axis bias and the ARW averaged over the alignment time, so this one test exercises bias, random walk and misalignment together. Acceptance repeats it after thermal cycling, vibration, shock and electromagnetic-compatibility exposure and compares calibration parameters before and after.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff\" is correct?","options":["陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。","環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。","整機最嚴格的功能驗證是靜態陀螺羅經對準：單元只靠量到的地球自轉水平分量 Ω_E·cosφ 找出真北，航向誤差直接由水平軸的零偏與一段對準時間內的 ARW 平均決定，因此這一項同時檢驗零偏、隨機漫步與誤準。"],"optionsEn":["Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time.","A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.","The most demanding functional check of the finished unit is static gyrocompass alignment: using only the measured horizontal Earth-rate component Ω_E·cosφ the unit finds true north, and the heading error follows directly from horizontal-axis bias and the ARW averaged over the alignment time, so this one test exercises bias, random walk and misalignment together."],"answer":2,"explanation":"整機最嚴格的功能驗證是靜態陀螺羅經對準：單元只靠量到的地球自轉水平分量 Ω_E·cosφ 找出真北，航向誤差直接由水平軸的零偏與一段對準時間內的 ARW 平均決定，因此這一項同時檢驗零偏、隨機漫步與誤準。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The most demanding functional check of the finished unit is static gyrocompass alignment: using only the measured horizontal Earth-rate component Ω_E·cosφ the unit finds true north, and the heading error follows directly from horizontal-axis bias and the ARW averaged over the alignment time, so this one test exercises bias, random walk and misalignment together. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a438-v12-30","title":"陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「陀螺羅經對準與驗收報告」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Gyrocompass alignment and acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：航向誤差 δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ)。在北緯 25°，Ω_E·cosφ = 15.04×0.906 = 13.63 °/h。水平軸零偏 0.01 °/h 給 δψ = 7.3×10⁻⁴ rad ≈ 2.5 arcmin；對準 10 min 時 ARW 0.005 °/√h 的平均殘餘為 0.005/√(1/6) = 0.012 °/h，再給 3.1 arcmin；兩者均方根合成約 4.0 arcmin ≈ 0.066°。在高緯度 60°，分母縮為 7.5 °/h，同樣誤差源給出近兩倍的航向誤差。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Heading error δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ). At 25° N, Ω_E·cosφ = 15.04×0.906 = 13.63 °/h. A horizontal-axis bias of 0.01 °/h gives δψ = 7.3×10⁻⁴ rad ≈ 2.5 arcmin; over a 10 min alignment an ARW of 0.005 °/√h leaves 0.005/√(1/6) = 0.012 °/h, another 3.1 arcmin; the root-sum-square is about 4.0 arcmin ≈ 0.066°. At 60° latitude the denominator shrinks to 7.5 °/h and the same error sources give nearly twice the heading error. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把單元放在已知真北方位（以天文或大地測量基準標定到 0.5 arcmin 內）的基座上，做 20 次 10 min 對準，統計航向誤差的平均與標準差：平均值反映零偏與誤準，標準差反映 ARW；環境試驗後重做並要求參數漂移小於允收門檻，所有數據與校正表一起進入交接文件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place the unit on a pedestal whose true-north azimuth is known to 0.5 arcmin from astronomical or geodetic reference, run 20 alignments of 10 min each and compute the mean and standard deviation of heading error: the mean reflects bias and misalignment, the standard deviation reflects ARW; repeat after environmental exposure, require parameter drift below the acceptance threshold and put all data and calibration tables into the handoff package.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"航向誤差 δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ)。在北緯 25°，Ω_E·cosφ = 15.04×0.906 = 13.63 °/h。水平軸零偏 0.01 °/h 給 δψ = 7.3×10⁻⁴ rad ≈ 2.5 arcmin；對準 10 min 時 ARW 0.005 °/√h 的平均殘餘為 0.005/√(1/6) = 0.012 °/h，再給 3.1 arcmin；兩者均方根合成約 4.0 arcmin ≈ 0.066°。在高緯度 60°，分母縮為 7.5 °/h，同樣誤差源給出近兩倍的航向誤差。","textEn":"Heading error δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ). At 25° N, Ω_E·cosφ = 15.04×0.906 = 13.63 °/h. A horizontal-axis bias of 0.01 °/h gives δψ = 7.3×10⁻⁴ rad ≈ 2.5 arcmin; over a 10 min alignment an ARW of 0.005 °/√h leaves 0.005/√(1/6) = 0.012 °/h, another 3.1 arcmin; the root-sum-square is about 4.0 arcmin ≈ 0.066°. At 60° latitude the denominator shrinks to 7.5 °/h and the same error sources give nearly twice the heading error.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["航向誤差 δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ)。","普通高反射雷射鏡（反射率 99.9%）就足以讓環形雷射起振。","比例因子由幾何決定，所以一經設計就不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["Heading error δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ).","An ordinary 99.9% high-reflectivity laser mirror is enough to make a ring laser oscillate.","Scale factor is fixed by geometry, so a designed value needs no calibration."],"answer":0,"explanation":"航向誤差 δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Heading error δψ ≈ δΩ/(Ω_E·cosφ). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a438-v12-31","title":"陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「陀螺羅經對準與驗收報告」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Gyrocompass alignment and acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把單元放在已知真北方位（以天文或大地測量基準標定到 0.5 arcmin 內）的基座上，做 20 次 10 min 對準，統計航向誤差的平均與標準差：平均值反映零偏與誤準，標準差反映 ARW；環境試驗後重做並要求參數漂移小於允收門檻，所有數據與校正表一起進入交接文件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place the unit on a pedestal whose true-north azimuth is known to 0.5 arcmin from astronomical or geodetic reference, run 20 alignments of 10 min each and compute the mean and standard deviation of heading error: the mean reflects bias and misalignment, the standard deviation reflects ARW; repeat after environmental exposure, require parameter drift below the acceptance threshold and put all data and calibration tables into the handoff package. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若驗收只做單顆陀螺儀的靜態漂移而不做整機陀螺羅經，誤準矩陣與抖動耦合的錯誤不會被發現；交到使用者手上後在高緯度的航向誤差加倍，被誤判為安裝基準面問題而拆裝重校，浪費數週。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Acceptance that measures only single-gyro static drift and skips unit-level gyrocompassing never exposes misalignment-matrix or dither-coupling errors; delivered to a high-latitude user the heading error doubles, is misread as a mounting-face problem and costs weeks of removal and recalibration.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把單元放在已知真北方位（以天文或大地測量基準標定到 0.5 arcmin 內）的基座上，做 20 次 10 min 對準，統計航向誤差的平均與標準差：平均值反映零偏與誤準，標準差反映 ARW；環境試驗後重做並要求參數漂移小於允收門檻，所有數據與校正表一起進入交接文件。","textEn":"Place the unit on a pedestal whose true-north azimuth is known to 0.5 arcmin from astronomical or geodetic reference, run 20 alignments of 10 min each and compute the mean and standard deviation of heading error: the mean reflects bias and misalignment, the standard deviation reflects ARW; repeat after environmental exposure, require parameter drift below the acceptance threshold and put all data and calibration tables into the handoff package.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","把單元放在已知真北方位（以天文或大地測量基準標定到 0.5 arcmin 內）的基座上，做 20 次 10 min 對準，統計航向誤差的平均與標準差：平均值反映零偏與誤準，標準差反映 ARW。","平均時間越長，陀螺儀的雜訊一定越小。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Place the unit on a pedestal whose true-north azimuth is known to 0.5 arcmin from astronomical or geodetic reference, run 20 alignments of 10 min each and compute the mean and standard deviation of heading error: the mean reflects bias and misalignment, the standard deviation reflects ARW.","Longer averaging always makes gyro noise smaller."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把單元放在已知真北方位（以天文或大地測量基準標定到 0.5 arcmin 內）的基座上，做 20 次 10 min 對準，統計航向誤差的平均與標準差：平均值反映零偏與誤準，標準差反映 ARW；環境試驗後重做並要求參數漂移小於允收門檻，所有數據與校正表一起進入交接文件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place the unit on a pedestal whose true-north azimuth is known to 0.5 arcmin from astronomical or geodetic reference, run 20 alignments of 10 min each and compute the mean and standard deviation of heading error: the mean reflects bias and misalignment, the standard deviation reflects ARW; repeat after environmental exposure, require parameter drift below the acceptance threshold and put all data and calibration tables into the handoff package. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a438-v12-32","title":"陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"prerequisiteIds":["a438-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「陀螺羅經對準與驗收報告」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Gyrocompass alignment and acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若驗收只做單顆陀螺儀的靜態漂移而不做整機陀螺羅經，誤準矩陣與抖動耦合的錯誤不會被發現；交到使用者手上後在高緯度的航向誤差加倍，被誤判為安裝基準面問題而拆裝重校，浪費數週。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Acceptance that measures only single-gyro static drift and skips unit-level gyrocompassing never exposes misalignment-matrix or dither-coupling errors; delivered to a high-latitude user the heading error doubles, is misread as a mounting-face problem and costs weeks of removal and recalibration. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件必須含比例因子、零偏、誤準矩陣、溫度係數、Allan 偏差曲線與鎖定門檻，使用者才能設定濾波器與判斷可用壽命。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff package must contain scale factors, biases, misalignment matrix, temperature coefficients, Allan-deviation curves and lock-in thresholds so the user can tune filters and judge usable life.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「陀螺羅經的航向精度只取決於陀螺儀零偏，與對準時間無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Gyrocompass heading accuracy depends only on gyro bias and not on alignment time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a438-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若驗收只做單顆陀螺儀的靜態漂移而不做整機陀螺羅經，誤準矩陣與抖動耦合的錯誤不會被發現；交到使用者手上後在高緯度的航向誤差加倍，被誤判為安裝基準面問題而拆裝重校，浪費數週。","textEn":"Acceptance that measures only single-gyro static drift and skips unit-level gyrocompassing never exposes misalignment-matrix or dither-coupling errors; delivered to a high-latitude user the heading error doubles, is misread as a mounting-face problem and costs weeks of removal and recalibration.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]},{"id":"a438-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「陀螺羅經驗證、環境試驗與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gyrocompass validation, environmental tests and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","環形雷射陀螺儀像機械陀螺一樣靠角動量守恆感測旋轉。","若驗收只做單顆陀螺儀的靜態漂移而不做整機陀螺羅經，誤準矩陣與抖動耦合的錯誤不會被發現。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A ring-laser gyro senses rotation through angular-momentum conservation like a spinning-mass gyro.","Acceptance that measures only single-gyro static drift and skips unit-level gyrocompassing never exposes misalignment-matrix or dither-coupling errors."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若驗收只做單顆陀螺儀的靜態漂移而不做整機陀螺羅經，誤準矩陣與抖動耦合的錯誤不會被發現；交到使用者手上後在高緯度的航向誤差加倍，被誤判為安裝基準面問題而拆裝重校，浪費數週。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Acceptance that measures only single-gyro static drift and skips unit-level gyrocompassing never exposes misalignment-matrix or dither-coupling errors; delivered to a high-latitude user the heading error doubles, is misread as a mounting-face problem and costs weeks of removal and recalibration. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-honeywell-gg1320an","v12o-tum-ring-laser-g","v12o-wikipedia-rlg"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
